{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"a74d1dfb-d98c-4005-8fa1-f5f847e37b9b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have Q1.6's question text and pre-keywords. Let me extract the key information:\n\n**Q1.6**: 面向硬件体系结构的多算子并发优化，算法层面有哪些设计空间和最佳实践？（算子排布与调度策略——如何根据硬件计算/存储能力编排并发算子的执行顺序；计算与通信 overlap 的算法设计——如 MoE 的 expert 计算与 all-to-all 通信重叠、多模态编码与融合的流水线化；算法层面的 memory planning——如何设计算子的中间张量生命周期以最小化峰值显存占用、支持并发算子的片上存储划分；融合算子/复合算子的算法设计——如何设计可融合为单 kernel 的算子序列以提升硬件利用率；结合硬件侧重：不同硬件平台（GPU SIMT、NPU 脉动阵列、TPU systolic array）对并发模式的偏好差异）\n\n**Pre-keywords**: 算子排布, operator scheduling, 执行顺序编排, execution order orchestration, 计算通信重叠, compute-communication overlap, double buffering, 显存规划, memory planning, peak memory minimization, tensor lifecycle, 算子融合, operator fusion, kernel fusion, compound operator, GPU SIMT, NPU脉动阵列, NPU systolic array, TPU systolic array, 硬件偏好差异, hardware preference divergence, 设计空间探索, design space exploration, 最佳实践, best practice, 架构感知优化, architecture-aware optimization\n\nNow let me do the semantic segmentation and search. I'll break Q1.6 into sub-clauses:\n\n1. **算子排布与调度策略** - operator scheduling, execution order orchestration\n2. **计算与通信overlap** - compute-communication overlap, double buffering\n3. **Memory planning / 显存规划** - memory planning, peak memory, tensor lifecycle\n4. **算子融合/复合算子** - operator fusion, kernel fusion, compound operator\n5. **不同硬件平台偏好差异** - GPU SIMT, NPU systolic array, TPU systolic array\n6. **设计空间探索与最佳实践** - design space exploration, architecture-aware optimization\n\nNow let me search these across the four directories. I'll do them in parallel.","signature":"a74d1dfb-d98c-4005-8fa1-f5f847e37b9b"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23813,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"515af790-a398-4cc3-9cc0-7f61d09