{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_Xa7AjRhNWYlpyNxaLSLL6152","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q1.6_L1_answer.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"515af790-a398-4cc3-9cc0-7f61d0946c9d","uuid":"9e5025fd-e829-4722-b22e-6d3f46818821","timestamp":"2026-05-30T19:30:33.205Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q1.6_L1_answer.md","content":"# Q1.6 — 面向硬件体系结构的多算子并发优化：算法层面设计空间与最佳实践\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| paper_secs/.../StreamTensor/1.1-Dataflow-Architecture.md | 5208.6 | Dataflow 架构的 Kernel/FIFO/Token 抽象，systolic array + SIMD 混合计算 |\n| knowledge_notes/.../Systolic-array Accelerator (for VLM Inference).md | 3882.9 | Weight stationary dataflow 32×32 PE array，GEMM tiling 执行流程 |\n| paper_secs/.../FlashFuser.../span-idpage-7-0...md | 3228.3 | FlashFuser DSM-based fusion 实验配置与对比 |\n| paper_secs/.../SambaNova/Streaming-Dataflow-enables-Pipelining...md | 358.1 | Streaming dataflow 空间融合：PCU/PMU/AGCU 组件，自动算子融合 |\n| experiment_notes/.../FlashFuser_...Inter-Core-Conn.md | 656.5 | DSM-based cluster-level loop scheduling, tile selection, resource mapping |\n| idea_notes/Comet Fine-grained...Overlapping...md | 1008.6 | Shared tensor decomposition + tile reordering + thread block specialization |\n| experiment_notes/.../Comet...Overlapping...md | 978.9 | Fine-grained fused MoE kernel: 86.5% communication hidden |\n| idea_notes/Welder Scheduling...via Tile-graph.md | 939.5 | Tile-graph 抽象：Propagate/SetConnect，inter-layer independence |\n| paper_secs/.../SCAR- Scheduling...Multi-Chiplet...md | 2159.0 | Heterogeneous dataflow MCM scheduling，inter-chiplet pipelining |\n| knowledge_notes/.../Hardware-Aware Balance Planning.md | 271.3 | PROBE greedy planning solver：T_window 约束下的 expert 复制决策 |\n| experiment_notes/.../Mirage Persistent Kernel...md | 243.4 | In-kernel parallel runtime：SM partitioning, cross-task pipelining, paged SMEM |\n| idea_notes/Nimble_...GPU Task Scheduling.md | 967.6 | AoT CUDA Graph scheduling + multi-stream DAG 并行化 |\n| experiment_notes/.../Lancet...Whole-Graph...Overlapping.md | 1158.1 | Whole-graph computation-communication partitioning + pipeline scheduling |\n| paper_secs/.../Meta_s_Second_Generation_AI_Chip...md | 920.3 | MTIA 2 NPU vs GPU SIMT 对比，model-chip co-design |\n| idea_notes/ParallelKittens...Multi-GPU-AI-Kernels.md | 300.5 | LCSC 编程模板：Intra-SM / Inter-SM overlapping 两种调度策略 |\n| knowledge_notes/.../Focus Unit.md | 311.7 | SEC/SIC streaming 子模块嵌入 systolic array memory interface |\n\n---\n\n## 一、算子排布与调度策略（主内容）\n\n### 方法1: AoT Whole-Graph Capture + Multi-Stream 并行调度 (Nimble)\n\n**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/Nimble_ Lightweight and Parallel GPU Task Scheduling for Deep Learning.md` (score: 967.6)\n\n**是什么？**\nNimble 将深度学习执行的调度从 \"runtime per-operator dispatch\" 转变为 \"ahead-of-time whole-graph capture + replay\"。通过 CUDA Graph API 预录制全部 GPU kernel calls，并在 DAG 上运行 Ford-Fulkerson 最大匹配算法自动发现可并行执行的算子，分配到多个 CUDA stream 并发执行。\n\n**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）：\n\n```\n算法: Nimble AoT Scheduling + Multi-Stream Execution\n输入: DNN 模型 M (静态计算图), dummy input X_dummy\n输出: CUDA Graph G (含多 stream 拓扑和同步点)\n\n===== 阶段 1: AoT Graph Capture =====\n1. 用 X_dummy 预运行 M 一次\n2. 通过 CUDA Stream Capture API 拦截所有 GPU kernel calls:\n   - 记录每个 kernel 的 launch parameters (grid/block dims, SMEM)\n   - 记录 kernel arguments (tensor pointers, shapes, strides)\n   - 记录 submission order 和 CUDA stream assignment\n   - 记录所有 cudaMalloc/cudaFree 调用\n3. 生成完整 CUDA Graph G_raw\n\n===== 阶段 2: Multi-Stream DAG 并行化 =====\n4. 从 G_raw 提取算子级 DAG D = (V, E)\n   - V: 算子节点 (每个节点 = 一个 GPU kernel)\n   - E: 数据依赖边 (u→v 表示 v 消费 u 的输出)\n5. 计算 Minimum Equivalent Graph (MEG):\n   - 消除 D 中的冗余传递边 (若 u→v→w 且 u→w, 则删除 u→w)\n   - MEG 保留了完整的逻辑并发信息\n6. 构建 Bipartite Graph B:\n   - B 的节点 = MEG 中的边\n   - B 的边 = 共享端点的 MEG 边对\n7. Ford-Fulkerson 最大匹配算法在 B 上:\n   - 每种 matching 代表一组无依赖、可并行执行的算子\n8. Stream 分配:\n   - 按 matching 结果将算子分配到不同 CUDA stream\n   - 最小化跨 stream 同步: 仅在 DAG 原始依赖位置插入 CUDA event\n9. 将 stream assignment 注入 G_raw → 生成最终 CUDA Graph G\n\n===== 阶段 3: Runtime Replay =====\n10. 推理时: cudaGraphLaunch(G) → GPU 自主执行全部 kernel\n    - 无 CPU mediation (无 operator dispatch/shape inference/kernel selection overhead)\n    - 多 stream 并发执行: GPU SM 持续工作\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `D = (V,E)` 是算子级 DAG，`MEG` 是消除冗余传递边后的最小等价图。`B` 的 bipartite 结构将 \"可并行性\" 编码为 matching 问题。\n- **复杂度分析**: MEG 计算 O(|V|+|E|)，Ford-Fulkerson O(|V|·|E|)。AoT preparation 一次性开销约 0.35s，在所有后续推理中摊销。\n- **数据依赖**: Stream 分配尊重原始 DAG 的数据依赖——仅在无依赖的算子间引入并行。\n- **并发可行性**: NASNet-A 的 DAG 中最大逻辑并发度达 15。Multi-stream 自身贡献 up to 1.88× speedup。整体 vs PyTorch inference up to 22.34× speedup。\n\n**硬件适配性**: Nimble 对 GPU SIMT 架构友好——利用 CUDA Graph 消除了 CPU→GPU dispatch 延迟（通常 ~100µs per kernel），同时多 stream 将 DAG 的逻辑并发转化为 GPU 物理并行。但对 NPU/TPU（无 CUDA Graph 等效 API）不直接适用。\n\n### 方法2: SM 分区 + In-Kernel Parallel Runtime (MPK)\n\n**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Mirage Persistent Kernel_ A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs.md` (score: 243.4)\n\n**是什么？**\nMPK 将 GPU 的全部 SM 物理划分为 workers 和 schedulers，在单个 mega-kernel 内部实现完整的 event-driven 并行运行时系统——替代传统的 \"kernel-per-operator\" 执行模型。\n\n**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）：\n\n```\n算法: MPK In-Kernel Parallel Runtime\n硬件: H100, 132 SMs → 128 Workers + 4 Schedulers (16 warps)\n\n===== SM 分区（编译期确定） =====\nScheduler_SMs = {0, 1, 2, 3}        // 每个含 4 个 warp (共 16 个 scheduler warp)\nWorker_SMs = {4, 5, ..., 131}        // 每个 SM 1 个 worker\n每个 Worker SM 维护: task_queue (device memory circular buffer)\n每个 Scheduler SM 维护: event_queue (device memory circular buffer)\n\n===== Event-Driven Execution Loop =====\n从 start event e0 开始:\n\nwhile (有未完成任务):\n  // --- Scheduler 端 ---\n  for each scheduler warp w ∈ {0..15}:\n    e = event_queue.dequeue()           // atomicAdd 出队\n    tasks = tGraph.get_tasks(e)\n    for task in tasks:\n      if JIT_mode:\n        worker = select_least_loaded_worker()\n        worker.task_queue.enqueue(task)\n      else:  // AOT_mode: task 已预分配到 worker\n\n  // --- Worker 端 ---\n  for each worker SM:\n    task = dequeue() or check_AOT_queue()\n    if task == null: continue\n\n    // Cross-task software pipelining:\n    Phase 1 (pre-load):\n      acquire_smem_pages(pages_needed)   // 申请 32KB pages\n      TMA_async_copy(global_src, smem_dst)  // 异步，不阻塞 compute\n    Phase 2 (compute):\n      wait_TMA_complete()\n      execute_kernel_body(task)          // Tensor Core MMA / CUDA Core SIMT\n      // 期间: 预取下一 task 描述符 (352 bytes)\n    Phase 3 (complete):\n      notify_event(task.output_event)\n      release_smem_pages(task.pages)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `tGraph` 是编译期生成的 task 依赖图。JIT 模式需 2 次同步（assign + complete），AOT 仅需 1 次但缺乏动态负载均衡。\n- **复杂度分析**: Worker-Scheduler 通信通过 device memory semaphores（atomicAdd/atomicCAS）。Cross-task pipelining 消除 pipeline bubble，1.2-1.3× speedup (B200)。\n- **并发可行性**: Kernel-per-operator 理论下限 ~10ms（纯粹模型参数加载时间），MPK 达到 12.5ms（仅比下限高 ~25%）。\n\n**硬件适配性**: MPK 深度依赖 Hopper 架构特性——TMA 异步 copy、DSM、SMEM pages。对非 NVIDIA GPU 平台（NPU/TPU）需重新实现 in-kernel runtime 概念。\n\n---\n\n## 二、计算与通信 Overlap 的算法设计（主内容）\n\n### 方法1: Fine-Grained Fused MoE Kernel with Tile-Level Overlap (Comet)\n\n**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/Comet Fine-grained Computation-communication Overlapping for Mixture-of-Experts.md` (score: 1008.6), `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Comet Fine-grained Computation-communication Overlapping for Mixture-of-Experts.md` (score: 978.9)\n\n**是什么？**\nComet 解决 MoE 中通信（token 粒度）和计算（tile 粒度，128×128）之间的粒度不匹配。通过 Shared Tensor Decomposition + Tile Reordering + Thread Block Specialization 将 overlap 从 coarse-grained chunk 级升级为 fine-grained tile 级。\n\n**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）：\n\n```\n算法: Comet Fine-Grained MoE Fused Kernel\n输入: tokens [M, N], routing_map, expert_weights\n输出: expert_output [M, N]\n硬件: H800 GPU (132 SMs), NVSHMEM\n\n===== Layer0: Communication → Computation Pipeline =====\n\nStep 1: Shared Tensor 沿 M 维度分解\n  shared_tensor = dispatch_buffer   // shape [M×topk, N]\n  分解为 M×topk 行 (token 粒度)\n  tokens 按 source_rank 排序:\n    local_tokens  → 聚集在前 (立即可用)\n    remote_tokens → 聚集在后 (需 NVSHMEM 拉取)\n\nStep 2: GroupGEMM Tile 计算顺序重调度\n  Tile 分类:\n    T_local:  仅含 local tokens → 优先级最高 (零等待)\n    T_mixed:  含部分 remote tokens → 中等优先级\n    T_remote: 仅含 remote tokens → 最后计算\n  // 在计算 T_local 的同时: 通信 TB 正在 NVSHMEM 拉取 remote tokens\n  // 在计算 T_mixed 的同时: 更多 remote tokens 持续到达\n\nStep 3: Thread Block Specialization (SM 分配)\n  通信 TB (n^c 个): NVSHMEM get token-by-token\n  计算 TB (n^p 个): CUTLASS GroupGEMM (TMA + MMA)\n  // n^c/n^p 比例由 Adaptive Assignment metadata 决定\n  // 两套 TB 由 GPU hardware scheduler 并发调度，互不干扰\n\n===== Layer1: Computation → Communication Pipeline =====\n\nStep 4: Shared Tensor 沿 N 维度分解\n  shared_tensor = GEMM_output_buffer\n  分解为 N/T^N 个列块 (T^N = tile N 维度)\n\nStep 5: Column-Wise GEMM + 通信重叠\n  for col_block in [0, N/T^N):\n    所有 expert 并行计算第 col_block 列块\n    // T^N 列完成后: 立即 top-K reduce + NVSHMEM write\n    // 不等所有列完成！reduce+通信 与 后续列 GEMM 完全重叠\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `T^N` 是沿 hidden dim 的 tile 大小（典型值 128）。`n^c/n^p` 离线 profile 决定——小 M 时 n^c 小，大 M 时 n^c 增大到 26-46。\n- **复杂度分析**: Tile reordering 仅需一次排序 O(M log M)。TB specialization 的关键是将通信和计算隔离到不同 TB——GEMM TB 使用标准 CUTLASS Hopper 实现（TMA + MMA），通信 TB 独立执行 NVSHMEM I/O。\n- **数据依赖**: 关键洞察——单 token 是最小通信单元，但 GEMM tile (128×128) 需 128 tokens 数据。Coarse-grained pipeline 必须等整个 chunk 到齐；Comet 的 tile reordering 使 local-only tile 立即开始。\n- **并发可行性**: Hide 86.5% communication（FasterMoE 29.2%, Tutel 68.6%）。单层 1.96× speedup vs Megatron-Cutlass。小 M 时 speedup 更高（2.37×），因为 kernel 内调度消除了 host 端 kernel launch 开销。\n\n### 方法2: Whole-Graph Stage Pipeline (Lancet)\n\n**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Lancet_ Accelerating Mixture-of-Experts Training via Whole Graph Computation-Communication Overlappi.md` (score: 1158.1)\n\n**是什么？**\nLancet 将 MoE 训练的前向/反向传播整体视为一个计算-通信图，沿 batch 维度划分为多个 partition，构造跨 partition 的 stage pipeline。\n\n**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）：\n\n```\n算法: Lancet Whole-Graph Partition + Pipeline Scheduling\n输入: MoE 模型训练图, partition 数 P\n输出: Pipeline schedule (每个算子的 start_time)\n\nStep 1: 图分区 (沿 batch 维度)\n  batch 划分为 P 个 partition\n  每个 partition_i 含:\n    Non-MoE Compute_i:  Attention_i → Router_i\n    All-to-All_i:       dispatch_i → combine_i\n    Expert_i:           Expert_FFN_i\n    Post_i:             后续 Normalization\n\nStep 2: 阶段 Pipeline\n  Stage 0 (Compute):  [NMC_0, NMC_1, ..., NMC_{P-1}]\n  Stage 1 (Comm):     [A2A_0, A2A_1, ..., A2A_{P-1}]\n  Stage 2 (Compute):  [Expert_0, Expert_1, ..., Expert_{P-1}]\n  Stage 3 (Compute):  [Post_0, Post_1, ..., Post_{P-1}]\n\nStep 3: Pipeline Scheduler 启动时间计算\n  start(NMC_i)    = max(end(NMC_{i-1}), end(Post_{i-1}_prev_layer))\n  start(A2A_i)    = max(end(NMC_i), end(A2A_{i-1}))\n  start(Expert_i) = max(end(A2A_i), end(Expert_{i-1}))\n\nStep 4: 重叠 Timeline (P=3)\n  NMC:     [0]   [1]   [2]\n  A2A:           [0]   [1]   [2]    ← A2A_0 与 NMC_1 重叠\n  Expert:              [0]   [1]   [2]  ← Expert_0 与 A2A_1 重叠\n  Post:                      [0]   [1]   [2]\n```\n\n**注解**: Lancet 与 Comet 的对比——Lancet 是 coarse-grained partition 级 pipeline（非 tile 级），但通过 whole-graph 视角将 Attention、Router、All-to-All、Expert FFN 全部纳入统一 pipeline，overlap 覆盖率更高。Comet 更适合单 GPU 单请求场景（kernel 内调度），Lancet 更适合多 GPU 训练场景（跨 partition pipeline）。\n\n---\n\n## 三、算法层面的 Memory Planning（主内容）\n\n### 方法1: Tile-Graph 抽象与 Memory Traffic 优化 (Welder)\n\n**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/Welder Scheduling Deep Learning Memory Access via Tile-graph.md` (score: 939.5)\n\n**是什么？**\nWelder 将 DNN 的 memory 优化从 \"为每对算子设计融合规则\" 转变为 \"在 tile-graph 上搜索最优 tile 连接配置\"。通过 tile propagation 自动对齐不同算子间的 tile shape，在 shared memory 中复用中间数据。\n\n**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）：\n\n```\n算法: Welder Tile-Graph Memory Optimization\n输入: DNN 计算图 G = (V, E)（operator 级）\n输出: 优化后的分层 tile-graph 执行计划\n\n===== 阶段 1: Tile-Graph 构造 =====\n1. 将每个 operator v ∈ V 分解为 operator-tile 集合:\n   每个 operator-tile 处理一个 output data tile [BM, BN]\n\n2. 建立 tile 级连接:\n   SetConnect(v_a.tile_i → v_b.tile_j, memory_level)\n   // memory_level ∈ {L0(register), L1(shared memory), L2(global memory)}\n\n===== 阶段 2: Tile Propagation（自动对齐 tile shape）=====\n3. 从 output tile shape 反向推导整个 graph:\n   for each edge (v_a → v_b):\n     output_tile = v_b.input_tile_shape\n     input_tile  = v_a.Propagate(output_tile)\n     // 基于 tensor expression 自动计算\n   // 关键性质: output tile shape 唯一确定所有 input tile shape\n   // → 相邻 operator 的 tile 自动对齐，无需手工规则\n\n===== 阶段 3: Traffic Cost Model =====\"\n4. memory_traffic = Σ (input_tile_sizes + output_tile_size) × num_tiles\n   // Inter-layer independence: 每层 traffic 仅由该层 output tile 配置决定\n\n5. 两层搜索:\n   外层 — Graph Connecting: 枚举每条 edge 的连接层 (L0/L1/L2)\n   内层 — Sub-Graph Tiling: 基于 traffic cost model 搜索最优 tile 配置\n\n6. 容量约束: MemFootprint(tile_config) ≤ memory_level_capacity\n   // SMEM: 227KB/SM on H100\n\n===== 阶段 4: 代码生成 =====\n7. 四指令模板: LoadTiles → ComputeTile → StoreTiles\n   映射到任意有层级 memory 的加速器 (CUDA/ROCm/GraphCore)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `BM/BN` 是 output tile 的 batch/channel 维度。`SetConnect` 在两个 operator-tile 之间建立连接。`Propagate` 从 output tile 反向推导 input tile。\n- **复杂度分析**: Inter-layer independence 将耦合的多层优化解耦为独立子问题——搜索空间从指数级降为线性级。\n- **数据依赖**: Tile propagation 的数学基础——给定 Matmul O[i,j]=Σ_k A[i,k]×B[k,j]，output tile [i₀:i₁, j₀:j₁] 唯一确定 input tile: A 需 [i₀:i₁, :], B 需 [:, j₀:j₁]。\n- **并发可行性**: 89 种非常规 fusion pattern 自动发现，含 48-operator fusion chain。BERT attention global memory traffic 节省 69%（840MB→264MB）。NeRF 7-layer MLP 全融合为单 kernel（5× speedup）。\n\n### 方法2: Paged Shared-Memory Abstraction (MPK) (辅助说明)\n\n**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Mirage Persistent Kernel_ A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs.md` (score: 243.4)\n\nMPK 将 shared memory 分为固定大小 pages（32KB），task 按需 acquire/release。编译期通过区间图着色将无重叠生命周期的 tensor 映射到同一 page。H100 上每 SM 7 pages，A100 上 5 pages。Cross-task pipelining 允许在当前 task compute 期间预取下一 task 的数据到空闲 pages。\n\n### 方法3: Hardware-Aware Balance Planning (PROBE) (辅助说明)\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hardware-Aware Balance Planning（硬件感知均衡规划）.md` (score: 271.3)\n\nPROBE 的 Greedy Planning Solver 将 expert 复制决策限制在 T_window 内——每个 rank 上非通信 kernel 的执行时间窗口。T_window^r 按设备计算-带宽比动态确定（高算力低带宽设备→小窗口→限制复制数量），最多 kmax=16 轮迭代。\n\n---\n\n## 四、融合算子/复合算子的算法设计（主内容）\n\n### 方法1: DSM-Based Cluster-Level Kernel Fusion (FlashFuser)\n\n**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/FlashFuser_ Expanding the Scale of Kernel Fusion for Compute-Intensive Operators via Inter-Core Conn.md` (score: 656.5)\n\n**是什么？**\nFlashFuser 突破单 SM shared memory 容量限制（H100: 227KB/SM），利用 Hopper 架构的 Distributed Shared Memory (DSM) 实现跨 SM 的 kernel fusion。中间 tensor 驻留 DSM（跨 SM 可见），无需 spill to HBM。\n\n**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）：\n\n```\n算法: FlashFuser DSM-Based Kernel Fusion\n硬件: H100 GPU, DSM bandwidth/cluster: 2 SM: ~8TB/s, 16 SM: ~4TB/s\n\n===== 编译期搜索 =====\n1. 算子链统一 Loop 维度建模:\n   X = {x_0, x_1, ..., x_{J-1}}  // 共依赖 loop 维度\n   每个 x_j: Spatial (多 SM 并行) | Temporal (单 SM 串行)\n   组合数: 最多 41 种\n\n2. Loop Schedule 影响中间 tensor 大小:\n   MNLK order: 需存储完整 C tensor → 可能 > 227KB → spill to DSM\n   MLNK order: 每次迭代仅 partial E → 可驻留 SMEM\n\n3. 两级 Hierarchical Tiling + Resource Mapping:\n   Cluster-level tile → 影响 inter-block data exchange\n   Block-level tile  → 影响 reg vs SMEM 分配\n   贪心: reusable tensor reg→SMEM→DSM→HBM 逐级放置\n\n4. Cost Model + Selection:\n   D_V = data movement volume per memory level\n   Cost C = max(V_l / B_l)  // 最慢 memory level 决定延迟\n   Pruning → ~1.15×10^6 候选 → Top-11 profiling → 选最优\n\n===== 运行时 DSM Primitives =====\n5. dsm_all_exchange: cluster 内 AllReduce/Mul\n   (TMA + mbarrier, cluster 内所有 Block 获得完整 C tile)\n\n6. dsm_shuffle: ring communication 交换 C tile\n   (Shuffle Group 内旋转 C tile slices)\n\n7. dsm_reduce_scatter: hierarchical two-level reduction\n   (intra-cluster + inter-cluster via TMA cp.reduce.async.bulk)\n\n===== Gated FFN 策略 =====\nSpatial Partitioning (cls_k=2):\n  不同 Block group 执行两个 GEMM branch → max 并行度\nSequential within Block:\n  同一 Block 串行 → min DSM communication\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: `X = {x_0,...,x_{J-1}}` 是算子链的统一 loop 维度集合。`V_l` 是在 memory level l 的数据传输量，`B_l` 是该 level 的带宽。\n- **复杂度分析**: 41 种 schedule × tile size 枚举 × resource mapping → ~1.15×10^6 候选。DSM latency ~20ns (cluster=2) vs HBM ~280ns。\n- **并发可行性**: vs Chimera 4.1× speedup，vs PyTorch 3.1×。Global memory access 减少 58%。SGLang E2E 平均 1.24× speedup。\n\n### 方法2: Streaming Dataflow 硬件原生融合 (SambaNova SN40L)\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2025/8-SambaNova_SN40L_Scaling_the_AI_Memory_Wall_with_Dataflow_and_Composition_of_Experts/Streaming-Dataflow-enables-Pipelining-and-Automatic-Fusion-with-Arbitrary-Access-Patterns.md` (score: 358.1)\n\n**是什么？**\nSN40L 通过 streaming dataflow 在硬件层面实现算子融合——算子以 coarse-grained pipeline 方式执行，tensor 被 tiled 并通过 PCU chain streamed，中间结果永远不物化到 off-chip memory。\n\n**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 计算流程）：\n\n```\nSN40L Spatial Fusion: Gated FFN (Gemm0 → Mul → Gemm1)\n\n硬件映射:\n  PCU 0,1 (Systolic):  Gemm0 (W @ X)\n  PMU I00,I01:         Gemm0 输出缓冲 (匹配输入带宽)\n  PCU 2 (SIMD):        Mul (SiLU gating)\n  PMU S0-S3:           Mul 输出缓冲 (容量拆分到 4 PMUs)\n  PMU T00-T03:         Transpose (access pattern 优化)\n  PMU T10-T13:         Transpose 输出缓冲\n  PCU 3,4 (Systolic):  Gemm1 (投影)\n\n数据流路径:\n  Input → [I00,I01] → Gemm0 → [W00,W01] → Mul → [S0-S3]\n       → [T00-T03] → Transpose (PMU access pattern)\n       → [T10-T13] → Gemm1 → Output\n\nTranspose 实现 (PMU 内):\n  写入: diagonal striped format across scratchpad banks\n  读取: normal + transposed 均以 full bandwidth\n  // 将 Transpose 算子从计算操作降维为 memory access pattern\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **变量含义**: PCU (Pattern Compute Unit) 可配置为 systolic array 或 SIMD pipeline。PMU (Pattern Memory Unit) 提供可编程 scratchpad 存储。\n- **硬件参数**: 1040 PCUs + 1040 PMUs，520MB SRAM，638 BF16 TFLOPs，2 dies (5nm, <650mm²)。\n- **并发可行性**: 无 kernel launch overhead——中间结果在 PMU scratchpad 中流式传递。编译器 PnR 自动将算子图映射到 PCU/PMU 阵列。\n\n---\n\n## 五、不同硬件平台的并发模式偏好差异（主内容）\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../StreamTensor/1.1-Dataflow-Architecture.md` (score: 5208.6), `knowledge_notes/.../Systolic-array Accelerator.md` (score: 3882.9), `paper_secs/.../Meta_s_Second_Generation_AI_Chip...md` (score: 920.3)\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph GPU_SIMT[\"GPU SIMT (NVIDIA H100)\"]\n        A1[\"HBM (80GB, 3.35TB/s)\"] --> A2[\"L2 Cache (50MB)\"]\n        A2 --> A3[\"L1/SMEM (227KB/SM)\"]\n        A3 --> A4[\"Register File (256KB/SM)\"]\n        A4 --> A5[\"Tensor Core (WGMMA, 989 TFLOPS)\"]\n        A4 --> A6[\"CUDA Core (SIMT, 60 TFLOPS)\"]\n        A5 --> A7[\"Accumulator (FP32)\"]\n        A7 --> A3\n    end\n\n    subgraph NPU_SA[\"NPU Systolic Array (Ascend 910B)\"]\n        B1[\"HBM (64GB)\"] --> B2[\"Global Buffer\"]\n        B2 --> B3[\"Input Buffer (128KB)\"]\n        B2 --> B4[\"Weight Buffer (78KB)\"]\n        B3 --> B5[\"Systolic Array (32x32 PE, FP16)\"]\n        B4 --> B5\n        B5 --> B6[\"Output Buffer (512KB)\"]\n        B6 --> B7[\"SIMD Vector Engine\"]\n        B7 --> B8[\"Activation Unit (SiLU/GELU)\"]\n        B8 --> B2\n    end\n\n    subgraph Dataflow[\"Dataflow RDU (SambaNova SN40L)\"]\n        C1[\"DDR (1.5TB, 200GB/s)\"] --> C2[\"HBM (64GB, 1.8TB/s)\"]\n        C2 --> C3[\"PMU SRAM (520MB total)\"]\n        C3 --> C4[\"PCU (Systolic/SIMD, 638 TFLOPS)\"]\n        C4 --> C5[\"RDN (On-Chip Interconnect)\"]\n        C5 --> C3\n    end\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **GPU SIMT**: 132 SMs，每 SM 128KB L1 + 227KB SMEM。Tensor Core 提供 989 TFLOPS (BF16)。动态 warp 调度自动隐藏 memory latency。适合 \"多 stream + kernel fusion\" 并发模式。\n- **NPU SA**: 32×32 PE array，weight stationary dataflow（权重预加载到 PE，inputs/outputs 流经 array）。确定性数据流——零 warp 调度开销。适合 \"GEMM systolic + SIMD vector 交替执行\" 的算子级并行。\n- **Dataflow RDU**: 1040 PCUs + 1040 PMUs。三级存储（SRAM→HBM→DDR）。硬件原生 streaming fusion——适合 \"空间 pipeline + 多 expert 并发 hosting\" 模式（DDR 存所有 experts，HBM 缓存活跃 expert，SRAM 执行当前计算）。\n\n### 各平台核心并发差异对比表\n\n| 维度 | GPU SIMT (H100) | NPU SA (Ascend 910B) | TPU SA (v5p) | Dataflow RDU (SN40L) |\n|------|-----------------|---------------------|--------------|----------------------|\n| **计算范式** | Warp-SIMT + Tensor Core | 32×32 Systolic Array | 128×128 Systolic Array | Configurable SA/SIMD |\n| **并发粒度** | Thread Block (1024 threads) | PE Array tile (m×32) | PE Array tile (m×128) | PCU-level pipeline stage |\n| **存储层次** | HBM→L2→L1/SMEM→Reg | DDR→GlobalBuf→PE Reg | HBM→VPU→MXU | DDR→HBM→PMU SRAM |\n| **算子融合** | 编译器 kernel fusion (SMEM 227KB 限制) | 编译器 layer fusion | XLA 自动融合 | 硬件原生 streaming fusion |\n| **通信 Overlap 机制** | Multi-stream + NVSHMEM + TB specialization | 专用 DMA 引擎 + AI Core/Vector 交替 | ICI (Inter-Chip Interconnect) | RDN + P2P protocol |\n| **最佳并发模式** | Kernel 内 TB specialization (Comet 风格) | 脉动流 + 向量引擎交替执行 | 大规模 systolic 批量 | 空间 streaming pipeline |\n| **关键约束** | Kernel launch overhead (~100µs) | PE array 尺寸固定 (32×32) | XLA 编译时间 | 需编译器 PnR 映射 |\n\n**笔记证据**: 此表综合了 `StreamTensor/1.1-Dataflow-Architecture.md` (score: 5208.6)、`Systolic-array Accelerator.md` (score: 3882.9)、`Streaming-Dataflow...md` (score: 358.1)、`Comet...Overlapping.md` (score: 978.9) 等多条笔记。\n\n---\n\n## 方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Nimble** | AoT CUDA Graph + 自动 multi-stream DAG 并行化 | PyTorch + CUDA Graph API | V100/A100/H100 | vs PyTorch up to 22.34×, max concurrency=15 | idea_notes/Nimble (967.6) |\n| **MPK (Mirage)** | In-kernel parallel runtime: SM 分区 + event-driven + cross-task pipelining | torch.compile(backend=MPK) | A100/H100/B200 | 12.5ms/token (下限~10ms), 1.2-1.3× speedup | experiment_notes/Mirage (243.4) |\n| **Comet** | Shared tensor decomposition + tile reordering + TB specialization | CUTLASS + NVSHMEM + Megatron | H800/L20 | Hide 86.5% comm, 1.96× single-layer, 1.71× E2E | idea_notes/Comet (1008.6), experiment_notes/Comet (978.9) |\n| **Lancet** | Whole-graph partition + stage pipeline scheduling | Tutel + NCCL + RAF | A100/V100 多节点 | 通信-计算重叠覆盖率分析 | experiment_notes/Lancet (1158.1) |\n| **Welder** | Tile-graph + tile propagation + traffic cost model | ONNX + tile-graph compiler | V100/A100 | DRAM traffic 节省 69%, 89 种 fusion pattern | idea_notes/Welder (939.5) |\n| **FlashFuser** | DSM-based cluster-level fusion + dsm_comm primitives | CUTLASS + CUDA 12.4 | H100 SXM | vs Chimera 4.1×, HBM access -58% | experiment_notes/FlashFuser (656.5) |\n| **SCAR** | Heterogeneous chiplet scheduling: spatial locality + dataflow matching | Custom scheduler | MCM accelerator (sim) | O(10^56)→sec-level search | paper_secs/SCAR (2159.0) |\n| **PROBE** | Hardware-aware greedy planning: T_window + water-filling | NVSHMEM + single-SM kernel | H100/H800 | Planning hidden by MoE compute | knowledge_notes/Hardware-Aware (271.3) |\n| **SN40L Streaming** | 硬件原生 streaming dataflow: PCU SA/SIMD + PMU composable mem | SambaFlow compiler | SN40L RDU (5nm) | 520MB SRAM + 64GB HBM + 1.5TB DDR | paper_secs/SambaNova (358.1) |\n| **ParallelKittens** | LCSC 模板: Intra-SM / Inter-SM overlapping + 8 通信原语 | ThunderKittens + CUDA | H100 (NVLink) | TMA + warp spec + 预分配缓冲区 | idea_notes/ParallelKittens (300.5) |\n\n---\n\n## 不确定性\n\n1. **NPU/TPU 的具体并发原语细节**：笔记中对华为昇腾 Ascend NPU 和 Google TPU 的算子级并发机制描述有限，主要来自 `Systolic-array Accelerator.md` (score: 3882.9) 和 `Streaming-Dataflow...md` (score: 358.1) 的知识笔记推断。笔记未明确说明 CANN 的算子级并发 API 和 Ascend 910B 的片上网络拓扑细节。\n2. **Lancet 在单 GPU 单请求场景的适用性**：Lancet 笔记主要覆盖多 GPU 训练场景的 whole-graph pipeline，在单 GPU 单请求推理场景下的适用性笔记未明确说明，标记为 \"可推断\"。\n3. **FlashFuser DSM capacity 与 cluster size 的精确关系**：笔记显示 DSM bandwidth 随 cluster size 变化但 DSM 总可用容量与 cluster 内 SM 数量的定量关系笔记未明确给出。\n4. **不同硬件平台对比的验证**：基于笔记内容跨硬件平台推断最佳实践映射，但部分对比（如 TPU v5p 的具体算子融合策略）笔记未直接验证。\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q1.6-L1\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":697,"newStart":1,"newLines":494,"lines":["-# Q1.6 — 面向硬件体系结构的多算子并发优化：算法层面的设计空间与最佳实践","+# Q1.6 — 面向硬件体系结构的多算子并发优化：算法层面设计空间与最佳实践"," "," ## 笔记证据概览"," "," | 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |"," |------|------|----------|","-| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashFuser.../FlashFuser-Expanding-the-Scale-of-Kernel-Fusion...md | 28077.6 | DSM-based kernel fusion，三级 memory hierarchy（reg→SMEM→DSM），dataflow analyzer + 搜索剪枝 |","-| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Kitsune.../Kitsune-Enabling-Dataflow-Execution-on-GPUs.md | 12458.8 | GPU dataflow 执行：ring queue + 双 arbiter grid scheduler，空间并发替代 temporal multiplexing |","-| paper_secs/secs_2025/11-StreamTensor.../StreamTensor-Make-Tensors-Stream...md | 11343.7 | Dataflow 加速器编译器：迭代 tensor type system，三级设计空间搜索（tiling/fusion/resource） |","-| paper_secs/secs_moe/PROBE.../PROBE-CO-BALANCING...md | 11001.9 | Continuous Lookahead Pipelining: predictor + balance planner + split-phase co-scheduling |","-| paper_secs/secs_2025/8-SambaNova_SN40L.../VI.-CASE-STUDIES.md | 2956.8 | Operator fusion impact: 2×–13× speedup；CoE 部署；三阶梯存储 streaming dataflow |","-| paper_secs/secs_2026/26-Accelerating Sparse Transformer.../4-Methodology.md | 1637.2 | STOF: binary hash encoding fusion + DFS/reward search，sparse MHA + dense downstream fusion |","-| idea_notes/FlashFuser_ Expanding the Scale of Kernel Fusion...md | 13.6 | Idea 分析：baseline 缺陷（SMEM 瓶颈/忽略 DSM/单一 tiling/搜索爆炸），DSM-aware 全栈方案 |","-| idea_notes/HyTiS_ Hybrid Tile Scheduling for GPU GEMM...md | 18.0 | 两级 tile 调度消除 wave quantization；architecture-aware profiling + adaptive layout |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/On-Chip Ring Network for NMP...md | 615.5 | NMP 环形网络：all-gather/reduce-scatter/scalar exchange + in-situ aggregator |","-| paper_secs/secs_2025/48-Meta_s Second Generation AI Chip...md | 920.3 | MTIA 2i: 8×8 PE array, NoC, model-chip co-design，44% TCO 降低 |","+| paper_secs/.../StreamTensor/1.1-Dataflow-Architecture.md | 5208.6 | Dataflow 架构的 Kernel/FIFO/Token 抽象，systolic array + SIMD 混合计算 |","+| knowledge_notes/.../Systolic-array Accelerator (for VLM Inference).md | 3882.9 | Weight stationary dataflow 32×32 PE array，GEMM tiling 执行流程 |","+| paper_secs/.../FlashFuser.../span-idpage-7-0...md | 3228.3 | FlashFuser DSM-based fusion 实验配置与对比 |","+| paper_secs/.../SambaNova/Streaming-Dataflow-enables-Pipelining...md | 358.1 | Streaming dataflow 空间融合：PCU/PMU/AGCU 组件，自动算子融合 |","+| experiment_notes/.../FlashFuser_...Inter-Core-Conn.md | 656.5 | DSM-based cluster-level loop scheduling, tile selection, resource mapping |","+| idea_notes/Comet Fine-grained...Overlapping...md | 1008.6 | Shared tensor decomposition + tile reordering + thread block specialization |","+| experiment_notes/.../Comet...Overlapping...md | 978.9 | Fine-grained fused MoE kernel: 86.5% communication hidden |","+| idea_notes/Welder Scheduling...via Tile-graph.md | 939.5 | Tile-graph 抽象：Propagate/SetConnect，inter-layer independence |","+| paper_secs/.../SCAR- Scheduling...Multi-Chiplet...md | 2159.0 | Heterogeneous dataflow MCM scheduling，inter-chiplet pipelining |","+| knowledge_notes/.../Hardware-Aware Balance Planning.md | 271.3 | PROBE greedy planning solver：T_window 约束下的 expert 复制决策 |","+| experiment_notes/.../Mirage Persistent Kernel...md | 243.4 | In-kernel parallel runtime：SM partitioning, cross-task pipelining, paged SMEM |","+| idea_notes/Nimble_...GPU Task Scheduling.md | 967.6 | AoT CUDA Graph scheduling + multi-stream DAG 并行化 |","+| experiment_notes/.../Lancet...Whole-Graph...Overlapping.md | 1158.1 | Whole-graph computation-communication partitioning + pipeline scheduling |","+| paper_secs/.../Meta_s_Second_Generation_AI_Chip...md | 920.3 | MTIA 2 NPU vs GPU SIMT 对比，model-chip co-design |","+| idea_notes/ParallelKittens...Multi-GPU-AI-Kernels.md | 300.5 | LCSC 编程模板：Intra-SM / Inter-SM overlapping 两种调度策略 |","+| knowledge_notes/.../Focus Unit.md | 311.7 | SEC/SIC streaming 子模块嵌入 systolic array memory interface |"," "," ---"," ","-## 一、方法细节（主内容）：算子排布与调度策略","+## 一、算子排布与调度策略（主内容）"," ","-### 方法1：Kitsune — GPU 上的 Dataflow 执行模型","+### 方法1: AoT Whole-Graph Capture + Multi-Stream 并行调度 (Nimble)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Kitsune Enabling Dataflow Execution on GPUs/Kitsune-Enabling-Dataflow-Execution-on-GPUs.md` (score: 12458.8)","+**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/Nimble_ Lightweight and Parallel GPU Task Scheduling for Deep Learning.md` (score: 967.6)"," "," **是什么？**","+Nimble 将深度学习执行的调度从 \"runtime per-operator dispatch\" 转变为 \"ahead-of-time whole-graph capture + replay\"。通过 CUDA Graph API 预录制全部 GPU kernel calls，并在 DAG 上运行 Ford-Fulkerson 最大匹配算法自动发现可并行执行的算子，分配到多个 CUDA stream 并发执行。"," ","-Kitsune（NVIDIA, 2025）探索了在现有 GPU 架构上通过最小硬件改动实现 synchronous dataflow 执行的可行性。其核心洞察：GPU 的 BSP 执行模型与 DL 的 DAG 图结构存在根本性 mismatch——大量时间 SM 和 DRAM 利用率均低于 33%（Nsight Compute 实测）。Kitsune 通过两个互补的软件-硬件原语将 BSP 转换为 dataflow：(1) 基于 GPU atomics 的 L2-resident ring queue 实现 inter-CTA 通信；(2) 修改 Grid Scheduler 为双 arbiter（SIMT/TENSOR 类型）实现异构 CTA 在同一 SM 上的空间并发。","+**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）："," ","-**方法细节（达到 L1 算法粒度的伪代码）**：","-"," ```","-算法: Kitsune Spatial Pipeline Construction","-输入: DL 计算子图 G = (V, E)，算子类型映射 type: V → {TENSOR, SIMT}","-输出: 空间流水线计划 plan = (stages, queues, cta_assignment)","+算法: Nimble AoT Scheduling + Multi-Stream Execution","+输入: DNN 模型 M (静态计算图), dummy input X_dummy","+输出: CUDA Graph G (含多 stream 拓扑和同步点)"," ","-1  function BuildSpatialPipeline(G):","-2      // Step 1: 子图选择（基于模式匹配）","-3      // 匹配三种关键模式:","-4      //   (a) MLP: Linear(dim→hidden) → Activation → Linear(hidden→dim)","-5      //       中间 tensor shape: [B, hidden], hidden ≥ 768 时超 SMEM","-6      //   (b) Reduce: 多 GEMM partial sums → Elementwise Reduce","-7      //   (c) Multicast: Elementwise → {GEMM₁, GEMM₂}","-8      sf_nodes ← PatternMatch(G, pattern_library)","-9      ","-10     // Step 2: 流水线设计（插入队列节点）","-11     for each sf_node in sf_nodes:","-12         for each edge (opᵢ → opⱼ) in sf_node:","-13             if IsReduction(edge):","-14                 // 归约模式: many-to-one，构建归约树","-15                 queue ← CreateReductionQueue(arity=N_producers)","-16             elif IsMulticast(edge):","-17                 // 多播模式: one-to-many","-18                 queue ← CreateMulticastQueue(fanout=N_consumers)","-19             else:","-20                 // 标准模式: one-to-one，双缓冲 ring queue","-21                 queue ← CreateRingQueue(capacity=2, payload=64KB)","-22             sf_node.replace_edge(edge, queue)","-23     ","-24     // Step 3: CTA 资源分配","-25     for each stage in sf_node.stages:","-26         stage.cta_type ← type[stage.operator]","-27         // Input shape: [M, K]; Weight: [K, N]","-28         // Tile shape: Tₘ × Tₖ × Tₙ = 128 × 64 × 128 (FP16)","-29         stage.num_ctas ← ceil(M/Tₘ) × ceil(N/Tₙ)","-30     ","-31     // Step 4: cudaPipeline launch（新增 API）","-32     cudaPipelineLaunch(","-33         kernels   = [k₀, k₁, ..., k_N],         // 每 stage 一个 kernel","-34         dep_graph = queue_dag,                   // 队列数据依赖图","-35         type_hint = [TENSOR, SIMT, TENSOR, ...], // 资源类型标注","-36     )","-37     // Grid Scheduler (双 arbiter 硬件改动):","-38     //   - TENSOR arbiter: 将 GEMM CTA 分配到有空闲 Tensor Core 的 SM","-39     //   - SIMT arbiter:  将 Elementwise CTA 分配到有空闲 CUDA Core 的 SM","-40     //   - 同一 SM 可同时容纳 TENSOR_CTA × 1 + SIMT_CTA × 1","-41     return plan","-```","+===== 阶段 1: AoT Graph Capture =====","+1. 用 X_dummy 预运行 M 一次","+2. 通过 CUDA Stream Capture API 拦截所有 GPU kernel calls:","+   - 记录每个 kernel 的 launch parameters (grid/block dims, SMEM)","+   - 记录 kernel arguments (tensor pointers, shapes, strides)","+   - 记录 submission order 和 CUDA stream assignment","+   - 记录所有 cudaMalloc/cudaFree 调用","+3. 生成完整 CUDA Graph G_raw"," ","-**Kitsune Ring Queue 核心原语**（L2 驻留，per-entry cache-line padded）：","+===== 阶段 2: Multi-Stream DAG 并行化 =====","+4. 从 G_raw 提取算子级 DAG D = (V, E)","+   - V: 算子节点 (每个节点 = 一个 GPU kernel)","+   - E: 数据依赖边 (u→v 表示 v 消费 u 的输出)","+5. 计算 Minimum Equivalent Graph (MEG):","+   - 消除 D 中的冗余传递边 (若 u→v→w 且 u→w, 则删除 u→w)","+   - MEG 保留了完整的逻辑并发信息","+6. 构建 Bipartite Graph B:","+   - B 的节点 = MEG 中的边","+   - B 的边 = 共享端点的 MEG 边对","+7. Ford-Fulkerson 最大匹配算法在 B 上:","+   - 每种 matching 代表一组无依赖、可并行执行的算子","+8. Stream 分配:","+   - 按 matching 结果将算子分配到不同 CUDA stream","+   - 最小化跨 stream 同步: 仅在 DAG 原始依赖位置插入 CUDA event","+9. 将 stream assignment 注入 G_raw → 生成最终 CUDA Graph G"," ","+===== 阶段 3: Runtime Replay =====","+10. 推理时: cudaGraphLaunch(G) → GPU 自主执行全部 kernel","+    - 无 CPU mediation (无 operator dispatch/shape inference/kernel selection overhead)","+    - 多 stream 并发执行: GPU SM 持续工作"," ```","-// 数据结构","-struct QueueEntry {","-    uint32_t seq_num;          // 原子序列号（同步元数据）","-    float    payload[16384];   // 64KB tile 数据（FP32 = 16K floats）","-}; // sizeof = 64KB + 4B, padded to cache-line boundary"," ","-// Producer 端","-void producer_acquire(Queue* q, QueueEntry** entry):","-    wr ← atomicAdd(&q->write_seq, 1)","-    *entry ← &q->entries[wr % q->capacity]","-    while (*entry->seq_num != wr - q->capacity + 1):  // spin-wait","-        continue","+**注解**:","+- **变量含义**: `D = (V,E)` 是算子级 DAG，`MEG` 是消除冗余传递边后的最小等价图。`B` 的 bipartite 结构将 \"可并行性\" 编码为 matching 问题。","+- **复杂度分析**: MEG 计算 O(|V|+|E|)，Ford-Fulkerson O(|V|·|E|)。AoT preparation 一次性开销约 0.35s，在所有后续推理中摊销。","+- **数据依赖**: Stream 分配尊重原始 DAG 的数据依赖——仅在无依赖的算子间引入并行。","+- **并发可行性**: NASNet-A 的 DAG 中最大逻辑并发度达 15。Multi-stream 自身贡献 up to 1.88× speedup。整体 vs PyTorch inference up to 22.34× speedup。"," ","-void producer_release(Queue* q):","-    __syncthreads()              // CTA 内屏障: 确保所有线程完成写入","-    if threadIdx.x == 0:","-        q->entries[wr % capacity].seq_num ← wr  // 原子标记已填充","+**硬件适配性**: Nimble 对 GPU SIMT 架构友好——利用 CUDA Graph 消除了 CPU→GPU dispatch 延迟（通常 ~100µs per kernel），同时多 stream 将 DAG 的逻辑并发转化为 GPU 物理并行。但对 NPU/TPU（无 CUDA Graph 等效 API）不直接适用。"," ","-// Consumer 端（对称设计）","-void consumer_acquire(Queue* q, QueueEntry** entry):","-    rd ← atomicAdd(&q->read_seq, 1)","-    *entry ← &q->entries[rd % q->capacity]","-    while *entry->seq_num != rd:","-        continue","-```","+### 方法2: SM 分区 + In-Kernel Parallel Runtime (MPK)"," ","-**注解**：","-- **变量含义**：`write_seq`/`read_seq` 为全局原子计数器，实现无锁 producer-consumer 同步。`payload` 大小 (64KB) 是权衡结果——更小则原子操作 overhead 占比高（1KB 时 12× bandwidth reduction），更大则超出 L2 capacity 导致 HBM spill（256KB 以上性能下降）","-- **复杂度分析**：单 CTA 可维持 100M atomics/sec，每队列上限带宽 385–1541 GB/s（远超 L2 和 HBM 带宽）。54 队列（对应 108 CTAs for A100's 108 SMs）时 aggregate bandwidth 达 2 TB/s","-- **数据依赖**：Producer 必须先完成 tile 计算并 release 后，consumer 才能 acquire——形成 fine-grained pipeline synchronization。多播模式下一个 producer 可 feed 多个 consumer queues","-- **并发可行性**：TENSOR 和 SIMT 类型 CTA 可在同一 SM 空间并发——Tensor Core 执行 GEMM tile 时，CUDA Core 同时执行 elementwise 操作。这解决了 vertical fusion 中的 temporal multiplexing 闲置问题（同一时刻仅 Tensor Core 或 SIMT Core 之一活跃）","+**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Mirage Persistent Kernel_ A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs.md` (score: 243.4)"," ","-**实验环境**：NVIDIA A100 GPU (108 SM, 192KB SMEM/SM, 40GB HBM)；评估 DLRM、MeshGraphNets、NeRF、GraphCast、Llama 3 8B（推理+训练）五个应用。Kitsune 推理加速 1.3×–2.3×，训练加速 1.1×–2.4×，off-chip traffic 减少 41%–98%（推理）/ 16%–42%（训练）。硬件 synergy 实验：当 on-chip compute 和 L2 bandwidth 翻倍而 HBM bandwidth 不变时，Kitsune 实现 47%（推理）和 27%（训练）额外加速，baseline 仅 18%–26%。","-","----","-","-### 方法2：HyTiS — 面向 GEMM Wave Utilization 的混合 Tile 调度","-","-**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/HyTiS_ Hybrid Tile Scheduling for GPU GEMM with Enhanced Wave Utilization and Cache Locality.md` (score: 18.0)","-"," **是什么？**","+MPK 将 GPU 的全部 SM 物理划分为 workers 和 schedulers，在单个 mega-kernel 内部实现完整的 event-driven 并行运行时系统——替代传统的 \"kernel-per-operator\" 执行模型。"," ","-HyTiS 针对 GPU GEMM 的 **wave quantization** 问题：当 output tile 数量不能被 SM 数量整除时，最后一个 partial wave 中大量 SM 闲置。例如 1672×1024 GEMM 在 128×128 tile 下产生 112 tiles（< 132 SM），SM 利用率仅 85%。HyTiS 通过两级联混合 tile 调度解决——full waves 用大 tile（吞吐导向），partial wave 用小 tile（延迟导向），零额外同步开销。","+**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）："," ","-**方法细节（达到 L1 粒度的调度算法）**：","-"," ```","-算法: HyTiS Two-Level Cascaded Scheduling","-输入: GEMM dims (M, N, K), GPU spec (N_SM, SMEM_cap)","-输出: 最优配置 (K1_full_wave, K2_partial, layout)","+算法: MPK In-Kernel Parallel Runtime","+硬件: H100, 132 SMs → 128 Workers + 4 Schedulers (16 warps)"," ","-1  function HyTiSSchedule(M, N, K, GPU):","-2      // Phase 1: Offline Profiling（≈19 min on H100）","-3      C_TO ← ProfileAllTiles(GPU, constraint={","-4          SMEM ≤ SMEM_cap,    // SMEM 不溢出","-5          REG_spill == 0,      // 寄存器不 spill","-6          bM % 64 == 0,        // H100 wgmma 对齐约束","-7          one_tile_per_SM       // tile 足够大以有效利用 SMEM BW","-8      })","-9      // 按性能 top-15% 阈值保留候选","-10     S_TO ← TopPercentile(C_TO, p=0.15)   // 吞吐导向: e.g. 128×128×64","-11     S_LO ← TopPercentile(C_TO, p=0.15)   // 延迟导向: e.g. 64×64×32","-12     ","-13     // Phase 2: Runtime 两级调度","-14     N_TO ← ceil(M/bM_TO) × ceil(N/bN_TO)","-15     N_LO ← ceil(M/bM_LO) × ceil(N/bN_LO)","-16     ","-17     if N_TO ≥ N_SM:","-18         // Case A: 至少 1 个 full wave","-19         //   K1=large tile 处理 full waves → 保吞吐","-20         //   K2=small tile 处理 partial wave → 降延迟","-21         N_remain ← N_TO % N_SM","-22         K2 ← SelectBest(S_LO, constraint={N_LO ≈ N_remain})","-23     else:","-24         // Case B: 全部 partial wave → LO-only scheduling","-25         K2 ← SelectBest(S_LO, constraint={N_LO 最大化 SM 利用})","-26         K1 ← None","-27     ","-28     // Phase 3: Adaptive Tile Layout（GM vs GN）","-29     // 最小化 wave 级 DRAM→L2 流量","-30     s_opt_GM ← min(ceil(√(N_SM × bN/bM)), ceil(M/bM))","-31     V_GM ← ComputeDRAMTraffic(layout=GM, group=s_opt_GM)","-32     V_GN ← ComputeDRAMTraffic(layout=GN, group=...)","-33     layout ← (V_GM < V_GN) ? GM : GN","-34     ","-35     return (K1, K2, layout)","-```","+===== SM 分区（编译期确定） =====","+Scheduler_SMs = {0, 1, 2, 3}        // 每个含 4 个 warp (共 16 个 scheduler warp)","+Worker_SMs = {4, 5, ..., 131}        // 每个 SM 1 个 worker","+每个 Worker SM 维护: task_queue (device memory circular buffer)","+每个 Scheduler SM 维护: event_queue (device memory circular buffer)"," ","-**注解**：","-- **Wave quantization** 是 GEMM 在 GPU 上的普遍问题——tile count 与 SM count 的除余导致 partial wave SM 浪费。HyTiS 的两级 tile 方案无需沿 K 维拆分（Split-K）或 Stream-K 风格的 reduction sync——零同步开销","-- **Architecture-aware 约束**：H100 wgmma 指令要求 bM%64==0（Tensor Core warp group MMA 对齐），bM/bN 选择受 SMEM 容量硬约束（≤227KB/SM）","-- **Layout 自适应**：group-M (GM) vs group-N (GN) 布局选择影响 L2 cache hit rate——同一 wave 内相邻 SM 访问相同 A/B tile 从 L2 命中。实测 DRAM read 从 46%（低效布局）降至 20%（最优布局）","-- **对比 Split-K**：Split-K 额外消耗 70%+ device memory（workspace allocation），而 HyTiS 零额外内存","+===== Event-Driven Execution Loop =====","+从 start event e0 开始:"," ","-**实验环境**：NVIDIA H100 GPU，Triton compiler 后端。Offline profiling ~19 min；runtime 调度开销可忽略。","+while (有未完成任务):","+  // --- Scheduler 端 ---","+  for each scheduler warp w ∈ {0..15}:","+    e = event_queue.dequeue()           // atomicAdd 出队","+    tasks = tGraph.get_tasks(e)","+    for task in tasks:","+      if JIT_mode:","+        worker = select_least_loaded_worker()","+        worker.task_queue.enqueue(task)","+      else:  // AOT_mode: task 已预分配到 worker"," ","----","+  // --- Worker 端 ---","+  for each worker SM:","+    task = dequeue() or check_AOT_queue()","+    if task == null: continue"," ","-### 方法3：STOF — 面向 Sparse Transformer 的融合调度搜索","-","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/26-Accelerating Sparse Transformer Inference on GPU/4-Methodology.md` (score: 1637.2)","-","-**是什么？**","-","-STOF 提出用 binary hash encoding 将算子融合方案表达为可搜索空间，结合 DFS 扩展 + reward-based 参数采样的两级搜索，自动发现最优融合边界和 kernel 参数。核心设计：将 Transformer 分为 MHA（手动优化 kernel）和 downstream dense operators（自动融合搜索）两部分，通过 co-design 实现互补。","-","-**方法细节（融合方案编码与搜索伪代码）**：","-","+    // Cross-task software pipelining:","+    Phase 1 (pre-load):","+      acquire_smem_pages(pages_needed)   // 申请 32KB pages","+      TMA_async_copy(global_src, smem_dst)  // 异步，不阻塞 compute","+    Phase 2 (compute):","+      wait_TMA_complete()","+      execute_kernel_body(task)          // Tensor Core MMA / CUDA Core SIMT","+      // 期间: 预取下一 task 描述符 (352 bytes)","+    Phase 3 (complete):","+      notify_event(task.output_event)","+      release_smem_pages(task.pages)"," ```","-算法: STOF Fusion Scheme Conversion & Hierarchical Search","-输入: DL 计算图 G，融合模板库 T","-输出: 最优方案 scheme* + 参数 params*"," ","-1  function FusionConversion(G, T):","-2      // Step 1: Binary Hash Encoding","-3      // 算子序列: [MHA, LN, GEMM₁, GELU, GEMM₂, Dropout, Residual, LN]","-4      // hash code: [0,    0,   1,      1,     1,     1,       0,       0]","-5      // → 3 个 fused segments: {MHA+LN}, {GEMM₁+GELU+GEMM₂+Dropout}, {Residual+LN}","-6      scheme ← NumericEncode(G)  // 相邻同数字 = 同一融合段","-7      ","-8      // Step 2: DFS Fusion Boundary Expansion (Stage 1)","-9      for each segment in scheme:","-10         for action in [expand, seize, compete]:","-11             // expand: 合并相邻段（如将独立 BiasAdd 融入 GEMM chain）","-12             // seize:  CI 段抢占 MI-only 段的算子","-13             // compete: 两个 CI 段竞争独立算子→优先扩展仅 1 个 CI 的段","-14             new_scheme ← ApplyAction(scheme, segment, action)","-15             if Profile(new_scheme, K=5) > Profile(scheme, K=5):","-16                 scheme ← new_scheme   // 接受扩展","-17             else:","-18                 rollback","-19             // 约束: 每段最多 2 个 CI (compute-intensive) 算子","-20     ","-21     // Step 3: Reward-Based Parameter Sampling (Stage 2)","-22     for iter in 1..MAX_ITER:","-23         for each segment in scheme:","-24             n_samples ← base + (segment==best_gain ? reward_bonus : 0)","-25             params ← RandomSample(segment.param_space, n_samples)","-26             best_params[segment] ← argmax(Profile(segment, p) for p in params)","-27         if converged: break","-28     ","-29     return (scheme, best_params)","-```","+**注解**:","+- **变量含义**: `tGraph` 是编译期生成的 task 依赖图。JIT 模式需 2 次同步（assign + complete），AOT 仅需 1 次但缺乏动态负载均衡。","+- **复杂度分析**: Worker-Scheduler 通信通过 device memory semaphores（atomicAdd/atomicCAS）。Cross-task pipelining 消除 pipeline bubble，1.2-1.3× speedup (B200)。","+- **并发可行性**: Kernel-per-operator 理论下限 ~10ms（纯粹模型参数加载时间），MPK 达到 12.5ms（仅比下限高 ~25%）。"," ","-**注解**：","-- **Binary hash encoding** 将抽象融合模式量化为可枚举空间——类比数字电路高低电平。编码长度=算子数，相邻同值=合并。支持双向映射（hash↑/decode↓），与\"hash\"定义一致","-- **DFS 三规则**：expand（合并相邻段不变其他）、seize（CI 段从 MI 段\"抢占\"算子）、compete（两段竞争时扩展只有 1 个 CI 的段）——覆盖所有合法 scheme 变换","-- **Reward-based sampling**：每迭代固定总配置数，最高增益段获双倍采样配额——搜索效率比均匀采样高 6.7×","-- **两层分工**：MHA 使用手动优化 kernel（利用 mask sparsity 跳过无效计算），downstream 使用自动融合（灵活组合 GEMM/Activation/Dropout 等）——避免破坏 MHA 的精细优化","+**硬件适配性**: MPK 深度依赖 Hopper 架构特性——TMA 异步 copy、DSM、SMEM pages。对非 NVIDIA GPU 平台（NPU/TPU）需重新实现 in-kernel runtime 概念。"," ","-**实验环境**：NVIDIA RTX 4090 (Ada) 和 A100 (Ampere)；PyTorch + Triton + TileLang 实现（~5000 LOC Python + ~2500 LOC C/CUDA）。BERT/LLaMA/GPT-2/T5/ViT 模型。STOF vs FlexAttention: 1.8×/1.6× MHA 加速（RTX 4090/A100）；end-to-end vs PyTorch Compile: 1.3×/1.4×。","-"," ---"," ","-## 二、方法细节（主内容）：计算与通信 Overlap 的算法设计","+## 二、计算与通信 Overlap 的算法设计（主内容）"," ","-### 方法4：PROBE — MoE 推理的 Continuous Lookahead Pipelining","+### 方法1: Fine-Grained Fused MoE Kernel with Tile-Level Overlap (Comet)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/PROBE Co-Balancing Computation and Communication in MoE Inference via Real-Time Predictive Prefetching/PROBE-CO-BALANCING-COMPUTATION-AND-COMMUNICATION-IN-MOE-INFERENCE-VIA-REAL-TIME-PREDICTIVE-PREFETCHING.md` (score: 11001.9)","+**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/Comet Fine-grained Computation-communication Overlapping for Mixture-of-Experts.md` (score: 1008.6), `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Comet Fine-grained Computation-communication Overlapping for Mixture-of-Experts.md` (score: 978.9)"," "," **是什么？**","+Comet 解决 MoE 中通信（token 粒度）和计算（tile 粒度，128×128）之间的粒度不匹配。通过 Shared Tensor Decomposition + Tile Reordering + Thread Block Specialization 将 overlap 从 coarse-grained chunk 级升级为 fine-grained tile 级。"," ","-PROBE 引入 Continuous Lookahead Pipelining 范式，解决 MoE 推理中的\"双重惩罚\"——计算偏斜（expert 热点集中导致 GPU 间计算不均）与网络拥塞（All-to-All 通信在热点 GPU 堆积）相互耦合放大。核心创新：利用当前层的执行时间预测、规划、预取下一层 expert 权重，将控制面决策完全移出关键路径。","+**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）："," ","-**方法细节（达到 L1 算法粒度的伪代码与时序图）**：","-"," ```","-算法: PROBE Phase-Locked Co-Scheduling","-输入: MoE 模型层 L[0..D], GPU 集群 G[0..N-1]","-输出: 每层方案 plan[l] = (expert_placement, token_assignment, tx_schedule)","+算法: Comet Fine-Grained MoE Fused Kernel","+输入: tokens [M, N], routing_map, expert_weights","+输出: expert_output [M, N]","+硬件: H800 GPU (132 SMs), NVSHMEM"," ","-1  function PROBE_ContinuousLookahead(G, L):","-2      // 初始化: Gate-Initialized Lookahead Predictor","-3      predictor ← DistillRouter(L.target_router)","-4          // 以 target router 权重初始化, 轻量 NN 蒸馏","-5          // 预测下一层 expert 激活 (fidelity > 0.9 top-2)","-6      ","-7      for l in 0..D-1:","-8          // === Track A: 主执行流 ===","-9          tokens_gpu ← AllToAllDispatch(tokens, plan[l])","-10         GEMM_Expert(tokens_gpu, plan[l].local_experts)","-11         tokens ← AllToAllCombine(outputs)","-12         Attention(tokens)","-13         ","-14         // === Track B: 控制面（与主执行流并行） ===","-15         // 预测（与 All-to-All 并行: network-bound, SM 闲置）","-16         async:","-17             n̂[l+1] ← predictor.Predict(current_tokens, l+1)","-18         ","-19         // 规划（与 GEMM 并行: compute-bound, 网络闲置）","-20         async:","-21             plan[l+1] ← BalancePlanning(n̂[l+1], G, {","-22                 hiding_window: T_GEMM[l],     // GEMM 执行时间窗口","-23                 max_replicas: 3,              // 每 expert 最多 3 副本","-24                 BW_NVLink: 900 GB/s           // NVLink 双向带宽","-25             })","-26         ","-27         // 预取（与 GEMM 并行: split-phase 避免竞争 All-to-All 带宽）","-28         async:","-29             for (expert, src, dst) in plan[l+1].moves:","-30                 // 前半段: GEMM 计算期间 P2P 传输","-31                 GPU_P2P_Send(expert.weights[0:HALF], src→dst)","-32                 // 等待 All-to-All 完成...","-33                 // 后半段: 下一个 All-to-All 期间传输","-34                 GPU_P2P_Send(expert.weights[HALF:END], src→dst)","-35     ","-36     return plan","+===== Layer0: Communication → Computation Pipeline ====="," ","-// === Balance Planning Greedy Solver ===","-37  function BalancePlanning(n̂, G, constraints):","-38      // Water-filling 算法: 迭代将 bottleneck rank 的 heaviest expert","-39      // 复制到 earliest-idle helper rank","-40      L[r] ← T_comp(n̂[r]) + T_comm(n̂[r])  for r in 0..N-1","-41      for k = 1 to K_max (=16):","-42          r_src ← argmax_r L[r]","-43          r_dst ← argmin_r L[r]","-44          e* ← heaviest_expert_on(r_src)","-45          T_trans ← (size(e*) × n_tokens(e*, r_src→r_dst)) / BW_NVLink","-46          if T_trans ≤ min(T_window[r_src], T_window[r_dst]):","-47              Δ ← min(excess(r_src, e*), capacity(r_dst))","-48              A[r_src→r_dst, e*] += Δ","-49              update L[r_src], L[r_dst]","-50          if gain ≤ ε: break","-51      return (expert_replicas, A)","-```","+Step 1: Shared Tensor 沿 M 维度分解","+  shared_tensor = dispatch_buffer   // shape [M×topk, N]","+  分解为 M×topk 行 (token 粒度)","+  tokens 按 source_rank 排序:","+    local_tokens  → 聚集在前 (立即可用)","+    remote_tokens → 聚集在后 (需 NVSHMEM 拉取)"," ","-**Split-Phase Transmission 时序图**：","+Step 2: GroupGEMM Tile 计算顺序重调度","+  Tile 分类:","+    T_local:  仅含 local tokens → 优先级最高 (零等待)","+    T_mixed:  含部分 remote tokens → 中等优先级","+    T_remote: 仅含 remote tokens → 最后计算","+  // 在计算 T_local 的同时: 通信 TB 正在 NVSHMEM 拉取 remote tokens","+  // 在计算 T_mixed 的同时: 更多 remote tokens 持续到达"," ","-```","-层 l 执行时间线 (单 GPU 视角):","-|←—————————————————— T_layer[l] —————————————————————→|","-| All-to-All  |    GEMM(expert)     | All-to-All | Attn |","-|  (dispatch) |                     | (combine)  |      |","-|             |←—— hiding_window ——→|            |      |","-|             | P2P Prefetch 前半段  | P2P 后半段  |      |","-|             | (expert weights 0:½) | (½:end)    |      |","-| Predictor   | Balance Planner     |            |      |","-| (下一层)    | (下一层)            |            |      |","+Step 3: Thread Block Specialization (SM 分配)","+  通信 TB (n^c 个): NVSHMEM get token-by-token","+  计算 TB (n^p 个): CUTLASS GroupGEMM (TMA + MMA)","+  // n^c/n^p 比例由 Adaptive Assignment metadata 决定","+  // 两套 TB 由 GPU hardware scheduler 并发调度，互不干扰"," ","-资源利用互补:","-  All-to-All → network-bound, SM 闲置    → 运行 Predictor","-  GEMM       → compute-bound, 网络闲置  → 运行 Planner + P2P 传输","-  Attention  → memory-bound, 两者均有闲置 → 下一层预测开始","-```","+===== Layer1: Computation → Communication Pipeline ====="," ","-**注解**：","-- **变量含义**：`n̂[l+1]` 由 Lookahead Predictor 提前一层预测（fidelity > 0.9 top-2 命中率），基于当前层 gating logits。`hiding_window` 是硬件 profiler 静态获取的 GEMM 执行时间——P2P 传输必须在此窗口内完成","-- **Split-phase 核心洞察**：expert weight P2P transfer 与 All-to-All collective 共享 NVLink 物理链路——两者不应同时进行（带宽竞争）→ 前半段在 GEMM 期间（避开 All-to-All），后半段在下一个 All-to-All 期间（此时网络有闲置容量）","-- **Balance Planning**：Greedy solver 在严格 hiding-window 约束下最小化 max(token_per_gpu) + λ·max(expert_copies)。λ 平衡计算均衡与通信 overhead","-- **并发可行性**：控制面三个环节（predict/plan/prefetch）均与主执行流不同阶段并发——利用硬件资源使用互补特性（network vs compute vs memory bandwidth）","+Step 4: Shared Tensor 沿 N 维度分解","+  shared_tensor = GEMM_output_buffer","+  分解为 N/T^N 个列块 (T^N = tile N 维度)"," ","-**实验环境**：8×A100 GPU cluster（笔记推断），MoE 模型（Mixtral 8×7B 等）。PROBE 降低 prefill latency 最高 1.32×，提升 decode throughput 最高 1.3×。Predictor fidelity > 0.9。","+Step 5: Column-Wise GEMM + 通信重叠","+  for col_block in [0, N/T^N):","+    所有 expert 并行计算第 col_block 列块","+    // T^N 列完成后: 立即 top-K reduce + NVSHMEM write","+    // 不等所有列完成！reduce+通信 与 后续列 GEMM 完全重叠","+```"," ","----","+**注解**:","+- **变量含义**: `T^N` 是沿 hidden dim 的 tile 大小（典型值 128）。`n^c/n^p` 离线 profile 决定——小 M 时 n^c 小，大 M 时 n^c 增大到 26-46。","+- **复杂度分析**: Tile reordering 仅需一次排序 O(M log M)。TB specialization 的关键是将通信和计算隔离到不同 TB——GEMM TB 使用标准 CUTLASS Hopper 实现（TMA + MMA），通信 TB 独立执行 NVSHMEM I/O。","+- **数据依赖**: 关键洞察——单 token 是最小通信单元，但 GEMM tile (128×128) 需 128 tokens 数据。Coarse-grained pipeline 必须等整个 chunk 到齐；Comet 的 tile reordering 使 local-only tile 立即开始。","+- **并发可行性**: Hide 86.5% communication（FasterMoE 29.2%, Tutel 68.6%）。单层 1.96× speedup vs Megatron-Cutlass。小 M 时 speedup 更高（2.37×），因为 kernel 内调度消除了 host 端 kernel launch 开销。"," ","-### 方法5：Stratum NMP — 环形网络上的通信-计算 Overlap","+### 方法2: Whole-Graph Stage Pipeline (Lancet)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/On-Chip Ring Network for NMP (近存计算片上环形网络).md` (score: 615.5)","+**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Lancet_ Accelerating Mixture-of-Experts Training via Whole Graph Computation-Communication Overlappi.md` (score: 1158.1)"," "," **是什么？**","+Lancet 将 MoE 训练的前向/反向传播整体视为一个计算-通信图，沿 batch 维度划分为多个 partition，构造跨 partition 的 stage pipeline。"," ","-Stratum NMP logic die 上的 bidirectional ring network 连接 16 个 Processing Units (PUs)，通过三种集体通信模式（all-gather / reduce-scatter / scalar exchange）支持 MoE 推理的通信-计算 overlap。Ring router 内置 in-situ aggregator——数据流经时直接执行 element-wise add 完成归约，无需\"先存后算\"。","+**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）："," ","-**方法细节（MoE Expert 处理流水线中的 Overlap）**：","-"," ```","-Expert 处理流水线中的通信-计算 Overlap:","+算法: Lancet Whole-Graph Partition + Pipeline Scheduling","+输入: MoE 模型训练图, partition 数 P","+输出: Pipeline schedule (每个算子的 start_time)"," ","-时间 →","-[GeMM₁] ←— 使用 all-gathered 输入","-  |→ Ring All-Gather (输入 token 分片→全复制, 128 GB/s per link)","-[GeMM₂] ","-  |→ Ring Reduce-Scatter (partial outputs in-flight 累加→分片输出)","-         |→ 与下一 expert 的 GeMM₁ 并行 (overlap optimization)","-[GeMM₃] ←— 使用 reduce-scattered 输入","+Step 1: 图分区 (沿 batch 维度)","+  batch 划分为 P 个 partition","+  每个 partition_i 含:","+    Non-MoE Compute_i:  Attention_i → Router_i","+    All-to-All_i:       dispatch_i → combine_i","+    Expert_i:           Expert_FFN_i","+    Post_i:             后续 Normalization"," ","-Ring Network 三种通信模式及与计算的 Overlap:","-1. All-Gather:","-   - 数据流: PUᵢ 持有 token 分片 → ring 传播到所有 PUs","-   - Overlap: 部分数据到达即可开始 GeMM₁（streaming all-gather）","-   - Per-link BW: 128 GB/s, 总聚合 BW: 2.048 TB/s","+Step 2: 阶段 Pipeline","+  Stage 0 (Compute):  [NMC_0, NMC_1, ..., NMC_{P-1}]","+  Stage 1 (Comm):     [A2A_0, A2A_1, ..., A2A_{P-1}]","+  Stage 2 (Compute):  [Expert_0, Expert_1, ..., Expert_{P-1}]","+  Stage 3 (Compute):  [Post_0, Post_1, ..., Post_{P-1}]"," ","-2. Reduce-Scatter:","-   - 数据流: 各 PU 产生 partial output → ring 传递并累加","-   - Aggregator: in-flight element-wise add (零额外延迟)","-   - Overlap: 与下一 expert GeMM₁ 可流水线化","+Step 3: Pipeline Scheduler 启动时间计算","+  start(NMC_i)    = max(end(NMC_{i-1}), end(Post_{i-1}_prev_layer))","+  start(A2A_i)    = max(end(NMC_i), end(A2A_{i-1}))","+  start(Expert_i) = max(end(A2A_i), end(Expert_{i-1}))"," ","-3. Scalar Exchange (Attention Softmax):","-   - 数据流: 仅传输 local max/sum 标量值 (极小 BW)","-   - Overlap: 无需求（标量传输延迟可忽略）","+Step 4: 重叠 Timeline (P=3)","+  NMC:     [0]   [1]   [2]","+  A2A:           [0]   [1]   [2]    ← A2A_0 与 NMC_1 重叠","+  Expert:              [0]   [1]   [2]  ← Expert_0 与 A2A_1 重叠","+  Post:                      [0]   [1]   [2]"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **Ring vs Crossbar**：Ring 物理设计简单（每 PU 仅 2 neighbor ports），scalability 好（增加 PU 不增加 per-PU 互联复杂度），但 all-gather 需 log(N) 步——通过通信-计算 overlap 隐藏 ring 延迟","-- **In-situ reduction**：aggregator 在数据流经 router 时直接累加——消除 \"store → load → compute\" 的冗余数据搬移。借鉴 systolic array 的 data stationary 思想和 Google TPU 的 ring-based reduce 设计","-- **仅 NMP mode 激活**：regular memory mode 下 ring network inactive 以省电","-- **通信模式与 overlap 关系**：All-Gather 与 GeMM₂ 可流水线化（部分数据到达即开始计算）；Reduce-Scatter 与下一 expert 的 GeMM₁ 可 overlap","+**注解**: Lancet 与 Comet 的对比——Lancet 是 coarse-grained partition 级 pipeline（非 tile 级），但通过 whole-graph 视角将 Attention、Router、All-to-All、Expert FFN 全部纳入统一 pipeline，overlap 覆盖率更高。Comet 更适合单 GPU 单请求场景（kernel 内调度），Lancet 更适合多 GPU 训练场景（跨 partition pipeline）。"," ","-**涉及论文**：Stratum: System-Hardware Co-Design with Tiered Monolithic 3D-Stackable DRAM for Efficient MoE Serving","-"," ---"," ","-## 三、方法细节（主内容）：Memory Planning 与算子融合设计","+## 三、算法层面的 Memory Planning（主内容）"," ","-### 方法6：FlashFuser — 基于 DSM 的大规模 Kernel Fusion + 三级 Memory Spilling","+### 方法1: Tile-Graph 抽象与 Memory Traffic 优化 (Welder)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashFuser Expanding the Scale of Kernel Fusion for Compute-Intensive Operators via Inter-Core Connection/FlashFuser-Expanding-the-Scale-of-Kernel-Fusion-for-Compute-Intensive-Operators-via-Inter-Core-Connection.md` (score: 28077.6) 和 `idea_notes/FlashFuser_ Expanding the Scale of Kernel Fusion...md` (score: 13.6)","+**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/Welder Scheduling Deep Learning Memory Access via Tile-graph.md` (score: 939.5)"," "," **是什么？**","+Welder 将 DNN 的 memory 优化从 \"为每对算子设计融合规则\" 转变为 \"在 tile-graph 上搜索最优 tile 连接配置\"。通过 tile propagation 自动对齐不同算子间的 tile shape，在 shared memory 中复用中间数据。"," ","-FlashFuser 是首个利用 H100 Distributed Shared Memory (DSM) 进行 kernel fusion 的 DL compiler。核心突破：将算子融合的中间 tensor 存储层级从 reg→SMEM 扩展到 reg→SMEM→DSM 三级，突破单 SM 227KB SMEM 的硬限制。当中间 tensor（如 FFN 的 C ∈ R^{128×16384} ≈ 4.2MB FP16）远超 SMEM 容量时，不再回退到 HBM round-trip，而是通过 dsm_comm primitives 将数据 spill 到 cluster 内多 SM 的 DSM 池（~8 TB/s BW, ~20ns latency vs HBM 3.35 TB/s, ~280ns）。","+**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）："," ","-**方法细节（达到 L1 算法粒度的 Dataflow Analyzer 伪代码）**：","-"," ```","-算法: FlashFuser Dataflow Analyzer（三级 Memory Spilling）","-输入: 计算图 g, 设备 d, 循环调度 s, tile 大小 t, 资源映射 r","-输出: 数据搬移量 D_V, 最终计划 p_final","+算法: Welder Tile-Graph Memory Optimization","+输入: DNN 计算图 G = (V, E)（operator 级）","+输出: 优化后的分层 tile-graph 执行计划"," ","-1  function DataflowAnalyzer(g, d, s, t, r):","-2      mapping_plan ← new ResourceMapping()","-3      D_V ← 0","-4      hierarchy ← d.getMemoryHierarchy()","-5          // [reg (256KB/SM), SMEM (227KB/SM), ","-6          //  DSM (cluster 内多 SM 聚合, BW ~8TB/s for cluster=2)]","-7      S ← g.getDimensionSizes()  // {M, N, K, L}","-8      ","-9      foreach tensor in g.tensors():","-10         DF ← GetFootprint(t.block)     // 单 tile 数据 footprint","-11         ","-12         if tensor ∈ g.IOTensors():","-13             // IO tensor: 计算 global memory 总数据搬移","-14             DM ← DF","-15             foreach s_i in reversed(s):","-16                 if s_i accesses tensor:","-17                     DM ← DM × ceil(S_i / t_i.block)","-18             D_V[global] ← D_V[global] + DM","-19         else:","-20             // Reused tensor: 贪心 spill plan","-21             remaining ← DF","-22             mapping ← new TensorMapping()","-23             ","-24             foreach level in [reg, SMEM, DSM]:","-25                 if remaining ≤ 0: break","-26                 alloc ← min(remaining, level.capacity)","-27                 mapping[level] ← alloc","-28                 remaining ← remaining - alloc","-29                 // 计算该层数据搬移量","-30                 // DSM traffic 是分析重点（BW 低于 SMEM，高于 HBM）","-31                 foreach s_i in reversed(s):","-32                     if s_i accesses tensor:","-33                         D_V[level] ← update_dv(t_i.cluster, DF)","-34             ","-35             mapping_plan[tensor] ← mapping","-36     ","-37     p_final ← (s, t, mapping_plan)","-38     return (D_V, p_final)","-```","+===== 阶段 1: Tile-Graph 构造 =====","+1. 将每个 operator v ∈ V 分解为 operator-tile 集合:","+   每个 operator-tile 处理一个 output data tile [BM, BN]"," ","-**DSM Communication Primitives 形式化定义**：","+2. 建立 tile 级连接:","+   SetConnect(v_a.tile_i → v_b.tile_j, memory_level)","+   // memory_level ∈ {L0(register), L1(shared memory), L2(global memory)}"," ","-```","-// dsm_comm 三原语","-dsm_all_exchange:","-  功能: cluster 内 AllReduce (标准 FFN) 或 element-wise Mul (Gated FFN with SiLU)","-  参数: cls_k — K 维度的 spatial partition 数量","-  示例: cls_k=2 → 2 Blocks 各算 partial C → DSM exchange + accumulate → ","-        各 Block 持有完整 C tile","-  BW: ~8 TB/s (cluster_size=2), latency ~20ns","+===== 阶段 2: Tile Propagation（自动对齐 tile shape）=====","+3. 从 output tile shape 反向推导整个 graph:","+   for each edge (v_a → v_b):","+     output_tile = v_b.input_tile_shape","+     input_tile  = v_a.Propagate(output_tile)","+     // 基于 tensor expression 自动计算","+   // 关键性质: output tile shape 唯一确定所有 input tile shape","+   // → 相邻 operator 的 tile 自动对齐，无需手工规则"," ","-dsm_shuffle:","-  功能: Shuffle Group 内 ring communication 重分布数据","-  参数: cls_shuffle = cls_l / cls_k","-  示例: cls_shuffle=2 → 2 Blocks 在 ring 上交换各自 C tile row slices","-  用途: GEMM₁ 阶段各 Block 需要 C 的不同 row slice 作为输入","+===== 阶段 3: Traffic Cost Model =====\"","+4. memory_traffic = Σ (input_tile_sizes + output_tile_size) × num_tiles","+   // Inter-layer independence: 每层 traffic 仅由该层 output tile 配置决定"," ","-dsm_reduce_scatter:","-  功能: 两级 hierarchical reduction","-  参数: cls_reduce = (cls_n × cls_k) / cls_l","-  数据流: intra-cluster reduce (DSM) → inter-cluster reduce (TMA cp.reduce.async.bulk)","-  用途: Store phase 合并各 Block 的 partial output E","-```","+5. 两层搜索:","+   外层 — Graph Connecting: 枚举每条 edge 的连接层 (L0/L1/L2)","+   内层 — Sub-Graph Tiling: 基于 traffic cost model 搜索最优 tile 配置"," ","-**Gated FFN (SwiGLU) 的两种 DSM Mapping 策略**：","+6. 容量约束: MemFootprint(tile_config) ≤ memory_level_capacity","+   // SMEM: 227KB/SM on H100"," ","+===== 阶段 4: 代码生成 =====","+7. 四指令模板: LoadTiles → ComputeTile → StoreTiles","+   映射到任意有层级 memory 的加速器 (CUDA/ROCm/GraphCore)"," ```","-策略 A: Spatial Partitioning (最大化并行度)","-  - cls_k=2: 两个 parallel GEMM branches (Up+Gate) 分配不同 Block 组","-  - dsm_all_exchange 执行 element-wise Mul (SiLU × Linear)","-  - 适用: 大 batch, cluster 内 Block 充足"," ","-策略 B: Sequential Execution (最小化 DSM 通信)","-  - K-dim 加倍, 两 GEMM 在同一 Block 内顺序执行","-  - 适用: 小 batch, DSM BW 为瓶颈","+**注解**:","+- **变量含义**: `BM/BN` 是 output tile 的 batch/channel 维度。`SetConnect` 在两个 operator-tile 之间建立连接。`Propagate` 从 output tile 反向推导 input tile。","+- **复杂度分析**: Inter-layer independence 将耦合的多层优化解耦为独立子问题——搜索空间从指数级降为线性级。","+- **数据依赖**: Tile propagation 的数学基础——给定 Matmul O[i,j]=Σ_k A[i,k]×B[k,j]，output tile [i₀:i₁, j₀:j₁] 唯一确定 input tile: A 需 [i₀:i₁, :], B 需 [:, j₀:j₁]。","+- **并发可行性**: 89 种非常规 fusion pattern 自动发现，含 48-operator fusion chain。BERT attention global memory traffic 节省 69%（840MB→264MB）。NeRF 7-layer MLP 全融合为单 kernel（5× speedup）。"," ","-两种策略由 cost model 自动选择——体现 DSM-based fusion 的配置灵活性","-```","+### 方法2: Paged Shared-Memory Abstraction (MPK) (辅助说明)"," ","-**注解**：","-- **DSM 性能特征**：cluster size 2 时 DSM BW ~8 TB/s（2.4× HBM），latency ~20ns（1/14× HBM）。但随 cluster size 增大 BW 下降、latency 上升——需 cost model 精确建模 cluster size 对 DSM BW 的影响","-- **Pruning 效果**：原始空间 ~2.75×10^13 → 5 条规则剪枝 → ~1.15×10^6（>99.99% 缩减）。5 条规则：Divisible Tile, Cluster Size ≤ 16, Activation=innermost loop, Dependency≠spatial L, Memory Capacity","-- **Cost Model**：min-max formulation C = max_l(V_l/B_l)，识别 bottleneck 段 → Top-K=11 硬件 profiling（搜索加速 12–68× vs brute-force）","-- **全局显存访问减少 58%**（Nsight Compute 实测），kernel speedup 3.3× vs cuBLAS，4.1× vs SOTA compilers，end-to-end 1.24×","+**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Mirage Persistent Kernel_ A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs.md` (score: 243.4)"," ","-**实验环境**：NVIDIA H100 SXM GPU；GPT-6.7B/LLaMA-1B/OPT-1.3B/BERT/GPT-2；CUTLASS-based fused kernel 生成；M-dimension binning + runtime table lookup。","+MPK 将 shared memory 分为固定大小 pages（32KB），task 按需 acquire/release。编译期通过区间图着色将无重叠生命周期的 tensor 映射到同一 page。H100 上每 SM 7 pages，A100 上 5 pages。Cross-task pipelining 允许在当前 task compute 期间预取下一 task 的数据到空闲 pages。"," ","----","+### 方法3: Hardware-Aware Balance Planning (PROBE) (辅助说明)"," ","-### 方法7：SambaNova SN40L — Streaming Dataflow 的极致算子融合","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hardware-Aware Balance Planning（硬件感知均衡规划）.md` (score: 271.3)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2025/8-SambaNova_SN40L_Scaling_the_AI_Memory_Wall_with_Dataflow_and_Composition_of_Experts/VI.-CASE-STUDIES.md` (score: 2956.8)","+PROBE 的 Greedy Planning Solver 将 expert 复制决策限制在 T_window 内——每个 rank 上非通信 kernel 的执行时间窗口。T_window^r 按设备计算-带宽比动态确定（高算力低带宽设备→小窗口→限制复制数量），最多 kmax=16 轮迭代。"," ","-**是什么？**","+---"," ","-SambaNova SN40L 通过 streaming dataflow 架构将整个 Transformer decoder layer（20+ 算子）融合为单个 kernel call，中间结果通过片上 distributed SRAM（PCU/PMU 间的 RDN）流式传递，永不写入 HBM。其融合规模远超传统 compiler 的 1–5 个算子。代表性成果：Llama 3.1 405B 推理在 BF16 精度下达 129 tok/sec/user（当时最快公开 benchmark），HBM bandwidth 利用率 > 85%（GPU 方案通常 < 50%）。","+## 四、融合算子/复合算子的算法设计（主内容）"," ","-**方法细节（融合规模与收益对比）**：","+### 方法1: DSM-Based Cluster-Level Kernel Fusion (FlashFuser)"," ","-```","-融合粒度对比 (llama7B-4k-inference-prefill):","+**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/FlashFuser_ Expanding the Scale of Kernel Fusion for Compute-Intensive Operators via Inter-Core Conn.md` (score: 656.5)"," ","-Unfused baseline:","-  每层 decoder: ~30 个独立 kernel launch","-  中间 tensor: 全部经 HBM round-trip","-  Kernel launch overhead: 显著（decode 阶段尤为严重）","+**是什么？**","+FlashFuser 突破单 SM shared memory 容量限制（H100: 227KB/SM），利用 Hopper 架构的 Distributed Shared Memory (DSM) 实现跨 SM 的 kernel fusion。中间 tensor 驻留 DSM（跨 SM 可见），无需 spill to HBM。"," ","-Conventional Fusion (TensorRT / Chimera / Welder):","-  融合粒度: 1–5 个算子","-  SMEM 容量限制: 227KB/SM → 大中间 tensor 融合失败","-  Kernel launch 减少: 2–3×","-  中间 tensor: SMEM 内传递（小 tensor）或 HBM spill（大 tensor）","+**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 伪代码）："," ","-SambaNova SN40L Streaming Dataflow:","-  融合粒度: 20+ 算子（整个 decoder layer → 单 kernel）","-  中间结果: 仅经片上 SRAM/PCU-PMU dataflow（RDN）","-  Kernel launch: 1 次（整个 decoder）","-  HBM BW 利用率: >85%","-  操作强度提升: 2×–13× over unfused"," ```","+算法: FlashFuser DSM-Based Kernel Fusion","+硬件: H100 GPU, DSM bandwidth/cluster: 2 SM: ~8TB/s, 16 SM: ~4TB/s"," ","-**注解**：","-- **融合收益分解**：prefill/training 1.5×–3×（提升 operational intensity），autoregressive decoding 1×–13×（消除 kernel launch overhead + 减少 HBM traffic），FlashFFTConv 13×（极低 operational intensity → fusion 效果最大）","-- **Hardware-Orchestrated Launch**：decoding 场景额外 1.4×–8× 加速——kernel 执行时间极短（微秒级），软件调度 overhead 占比大，AGC 硬件调度消除此开销","-- **三阶梯存储**：片上 distributed SRAM（PCU/PMU 近邻，高 BW 低延迟）→ HBM（64GB, 1.8TB/s）→ DDR（1.5TB, 200GB/s）。streaming dataflow 将 data movement 约束在前两级","-- **带宽利用率对比**：SN40L decoding 阶段 HBM BW 利用率 >85%（权重 streaming + KV cache 读取），H100 优化实现通常 <50%——差异来自 GPU 的 kernel launch overhead、control flow 开销和冗余 data movement","-- **CoE 部署优势**：单 SN40L Node (8 sockets) 可 hold 850+ experts (TP8 latency)，DGX H100 需 19 nodes。DDR→HBM copy 比 DGX 快 15–31×","+===== 编译期搜索 =====","+1. 算子链统一 Loop 维度建模:","+   X = {x_0, x_1, ..., x_{J-1}}  // 共依赖 loop 维度","+   每个 x_j: Spatial (多 SM 并行) | Temporal (单 SM 串行)","+   组合数: 最多 41 种"," ","----","+2. Loop Schedule 影响中间 tensor 大小:","+   MNLK order: 需存储完整 C tensor → 可能 > 227KB → spill to DSM","+   MLNK order: 每次迭代仅 partial E → 可驻留 SMEM"," ","-## 四、不同硬件平台对并发模式的偏好差异（主内容）","+3. 两级 Hierarchical Tiling + Resource Mapping:","+   Cluster-level tile → 影响 inter-block data exchange","+   Block-level tile  → 影响 reg vs SMEM 分配","+   贪心: reusable tensor reg→SMEM→DSM→HBM 逐级放置"," ","-### 硬件平台并发范式系统对比","+4. Cost Model + Selection:","+   D_V = data movement volume per memory level","+   Cost C = max(V_l / B_l)  // 最慢 memory level 决定延迟","+   Pruning → ~1.15×10^6 候选 → Top-11 profiling → 选最优"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Kitsune...` (score: 12458.8)，`paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashFuser...` (score: 28077.6)，`paper_secs/secs_2025/8-SambaNova_SN40L...` (score: 2956.8)，`paper_secs/secs_2025/11-StreamTensor...` (score: 11343.7)，`paper_secs/secs_2025/48-Meta_s Second Generation AI Chip...` (score: 920.3)，`idea_notes/HyTiS...` (score: 18.0)","+===== 运行时 DSM Primitives =====","+5. dsm_all_exchange: cluster 内 AllReduce/Mul","+   (TMA + mbarrier, cluster 内所有 Block 获得完整 C tile)"," ","-| 维度 | GPU SIMT (H100/A100) | NPU 脉动阵列 (Ascend 910B, MTIA 2i) | TPU Systolic Array (TPU v4/v5) | Dataflow 加速器 (SN40L, Groq LPU) |","-|------|---------------------|--------------------------------------|-------------------------------|------------------------------------|","-| **并发模型** | BSP→Dataflow (Kitsune); Warp-SIMT + Tensor Core MMA; Grid Scheduler 双 arbiter | 脉动阵列 data stationary; 异构: Cube(GEMM) + Vector(elementwise) + AI CPU(control) | 二维 systolic array (128×128 MXU); XLA 编译期静态调度 | 空间 dataflow; PCU/PMU streaming pipeline; 数据到达即触发 |","-| **算子融合偏好** | Vertical fusion (temporal); FlashFuser DSM spatial fusion (cluster 级) | CANN 编译器图融合 (MatMul+All-to-All); Cube/Vector 串行 | XLA fusion passes; compute-activation pattern; 编译期边界确定 | 极致 spatial fusion (20+ 算子→单 kernel); streaming intermediate 零 HBM traffic |","-| **并发粒度** | CTA 级 (Kitsune); Cluster 级 (FlashFuser DSM); Warp 级 (HyTiS tile) | 算子级 (Cube/Vector/AI CPU 分工); CANN stream 同步 | 编译期 subgraph 级; TPU core-local + cross-core ICI | Sub-operator tile 级; pipeline 级 streaming; 数据驱动同步 |","-| **通信-计算 Overlap** | Ring queue double buffering (Kitsune, L2); Split-phase P2P (PROBE); CUDA Stream async | Ring-based reduce-scatter + all-gather (Stratum NMP ring aggregator) | ICI ring-based 通信; XLA collective scheduling | Peer-to-peer streaming protocol (SN40L); RDN control fabric |","-| **Memory 层次** | HBM→L2→L1/SMEM→RF (5 级); DSM 作为 L1.5 (FlashFuser); L2-resident queue (Kitsune) | 片上 SRAM + HBM 两级; CANN memory reuse 框架规划 | HBM→CMEM→VMEM; XLA 静态 buffer allocation | 三级: 片上 SRAM→HBM→DDR (SN40L); 编译器静态 bandwidth 建模 |","-| **调度方式** | Grid Scheduler 硬件调度 + CUDA Streams; 动态 | Task Scheduler 硬件 + CANN Runtime; 半动态 | XLA compiler 静态 schedule; 运行时仅执行 | AGCU 硬件编排 (SN40L); 编译器静态 DAG; 无运行时动态决策 |","-| **适用场景** | 通用 DL; MoE (PROBE); 大 batch 吞吐优先 | 特定模型推理; 华为生态 (MindSpore+CANN) | Google 生态 (JAX/TF); 大规模训练+推理; 规则计算图 | CoE 组合推理; 低延迟 streaming; SRAM-resident 模型 |","-| **瓶颈特征** | Memory BW (decode); SMEM capacity (fusion fail); Wave quantization (SM 浪费) | 片上 SRAM 容量; Cube 利用率; 控制流灵活性 | HBM BW (大模型); ICI BW (跨 chip); 动态 routing 支持弱 | HBM capacity (大 CoE); 编译器静态 schedule→动态模型不友好 |","+6. dsm_shuffle: ring communication 交换 C tile","+   (Shuffle Group 内旋转 C tile slices)"," ","-**注解**：","-- **GPU SIMT** 的核心矛盾是 BSP 模型 vs DL graph structure 的 mismatch——Kitsune 通过 ring queue + modified grid scheduler 引入 dataflow；FlashFuser 利用 H100 DSM 将融合规模从 SM 扩展到 cluster。笔记显示 GPU decode 阶段 memory-bound（HBM BW 是瓶颈）→ 算子融合的主要收益来自 off-chip traffic 减少","-- **NPU 脉动阵列**（Ascend 910B）采用异构计算单元分工——CANN compiler 做图融合，将 MatMul+All-to-All 合并——但 Expert-Token Resonance idea note 明确标注 \"论文未详细说明 CANN 版本或融合策略细节\"。MTIA 2i 采用 8×8 PE array + NoC，TCO 比 GPU 低 44%，已在 Meta 生产环境服务数十亿用户","-- **TPU Systolic Array** 通过 XLA compiler 静态调度所有算子融合——编译时确定一切，运行时无动态决策——偏好规则 Transformer 计算图，对 MoE routing 类动态 pattern 支持较弱（笔记未提供 TPU 的专门 section 详细说明）","-- **Dataflow 加速器**（SN40L）是当前对多算子并发最友好的架构——天然匹配 streaming，无 kernel launch overhead，无软件同步——但需要 compiler 做 place-and-route（类似 FPGA 的 HLS 流程），灵活性受限于静态 schedule","-- **StreamTensor** (score: 11343.7) 提供了 dataflow 架构的通用编译框架——迭代 tensor type system 编码 stream layout，三级设计空间（tiling/fusion/resource）自动搜索——FPGA 评估显示比 SOTA FPGA 加速器延迟低 0.76×，比 GPU 低 0.64×，能效比 GPU 高 1.99×","+7. dsm_reduce_scatter: hierarchical two-level reduction","+   (intra-cluster + inter-cluster via TMA cp.reduce.async.bulk)"," ","----","+===== Gated FFN 策略 =====","+Spatial Partitioning (cls_k=2):","+  不同 Block group 执行两个 GEMM branch → max 并行度","+Sequential within Block:","+  同一 Block 串行 → min DSM communication","+```"," ","-## 五、设计空间探索与最佳实践总结","+**注解**:","+- **变量含义**: `X = {x_0,...,x_{J-1}}` 是算子链的统一 loop 维度集合。`V_l` 是在 memory level l 的数据传输量，`B_l` 是该 level 的带宽。","+- **复杂度分析**: 41 种 schedule × tile size 枚举 × resource mapping → ~1.15×10^6 候选。DSM latency ~20ns (cluster=2) vs HBM ~280ns。","+- **并发可行性**: vs Chimera 4.1× speedup，vs PyTorch 3.1×。Global memory access 减少 58%。SGLang E2E 平均 1.24× speedup。"," ","-### 设计空间五维轴","+### 方法2: Streaming Dataflow 硬件原生融合 (SambaNova SN40L)"," ","-基于 vault 笔记证据，面向硬件体系结构的多算子并发优化设计空间涵盖五个正交维度：","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2025/8-SambaNova_SN40L_Scaling_the_AI_Memory_Wall_with_Dataflow_and_Composition_of_Experts/Streaming-Dataflow-enables-Pipelining-and-Automatic-Fusion-with-Arbitrary-Access-Patterns.md` (score: 358.1)"," ","-| 设计维度 | 关键决策 | 硬件依赖 | 代表方法与笔记证据 |","-|----------|---------|---------|------------------|","-| **D1: 并发粒度** | CTA 级 / Cluster 级 / 算子级 / Sub-operator tile 级 | SM 数量、SMEM 容量、inter-SM 互联 BW | Kitsune (CTA), FlashFuser (Cluster), SambaNova (tile) |","-| **D2: 执行模型** | Temporal multiplexing vs Spatial concurrency | Grid Scheduler 灵活性、SM 资源类型多样性 | Vertical: Welder/Chimera; Spatial: Kitsune/FlashFuser |","-| **D3: 通信模式** | BSP barrier vs fine-grained queue vs streaming FIFO | 原子操作吞吐、L2 BW、片上网状/环状互联 | BSP: cuBLAS; Queue: Kitsune (ring); Streaming: SN40L |","-| **D4: 存储层级** | reg-only / +SMEM / +DSM / +HBM spilling | 各级容量和带宽比 | FlashFuser (3级), Kitsune (L2 queue), SambaNova (3级) |","-| **D5: 调度策略** | 静态编译 / 动态 runtime / 混合 (offline + online) | Profiling 成本、模型结构稳定性、batch 变化 | HyTiS (离线+在线), STOF (DFS+reward), PROBE (runtime) |","+**是什么？**","+SN40L 通过 streaming dataflow 在硬件层面实现算子融合——算子以 coarse-grained pipeline 方式执行，tensor 被 tiled 并通过 PCU chain streamed，中间结果永远不物化到 off-chip memory。"," ","-### 最佳实践六原则","+**方法细节**（L1 算法 Pipeline 粒度 — 计算流程）："," ","-**BP1: 按硬件 memory hierarchy 设计融合边界**（FlashFuser 证据, score: 28077.6）","+```","+SN40L Spatial Fusion: Gated FFN (Gemm0 → Mul → Gemm1)"," ","-融合的可行性边界应由硬件 memory hierarchy 决定，而非算子语义：","-- 计算单 tile 中间 tensor 的 data footprint (DF)","-- DF ≤ reg → register tiling（最高 BW, 最低 latency）","-- reg < DF ≤ SMEM → SMEM double buffering","-- SMEM < DF ≤ DSM → dsm_comm primitives (FlashFuser)","-- DF > DSM → spatial partition along hidden dim (Kitsune)","+硬件映射:","+  PCU 0,1 (Systolic):  Gemm0 (W @ X)","+  PMU I00,I01:         Gemm0 输出缓冲 (匹配输入带宽)","+  PCU 2 (SIMD):        Mul (SiLU gating)","+  PMU S0-S3:           Mul 输出缓冲 (容量拆分到 4 PMUs)","+  PMU T00-T03:         Transpose (access pattern 优化)","+  PMU T10-T13:         Transpose 输出缓冲","+  PCU 3,4 (Systolic):  Gemm1 (投影)"," ","-**BP2: 利用硬件互补资源实现控制面 offload**（PROBE 证据, score: 11001.9）","+数据流路径:","+  Input → [I00,I01] → Gemm0 → [W00,W01] → Mul → [S0-S3]","+       → [T00-T03] → Transpose (PMU access pattern)","+       → [T10-T13] → Gemm1 → Output"," ","-识别执行流中 resource-usage gap（如 Nsight Compute SM/DRAM utilization < 33%）：","-- Network-bound 阶段 → 调度 control plane 计算（prediction, planning）","-- Compute-bound 阶段 → 调度 data movement（P2P prefetch, async copy）","-- Split-phase 技术避免不同通信模式的带宽竞争","+Transpose 实现 (PMU 内):","+  写入: diagonal striped format across scratchpad banks","+  读取: normal + transposed 均以 full bandwidth","+  // 将 Transpose 算子从计算操作降维为 memory access pattern","+```"," ","-**BP3: Wave-aware 粒度调度避免 SM 利用率下降**（HyTiS 证据, score: 18.0）","+**注解**:","+- **变量含义**: PCU (Pattern Compute Unit) 可配置为 systolic array 或 SIMD pipeline。PMU (Pattern Memory Unit) 提供可编程 scratchpad 存储。","+- **硬件参数**: 1040 PCUs + 1040 PMUs，520MB SRAM，638 BF16 TFLOPs，2 dies (5nm, <650mm²)。","+- **并发可行性**: 无 kernel launch overhead——中间结果在 PMU scratchpad 中流式传递。编译器 PnR 自动将算子图映射到 PCU/PMU 阵列。"," ","-Wave quantization 是 GPU 普遍问题：","-- Offline profiling 构建吞吐/延迟两类候选 micro-kernel","-- Runtime 判断 full wave vs partial wave → 自适应 tile 选择","-- Adaptive tile layout (GM vs GN) 优化 L2 cache affinity","-- 零额外同步开销（vs Split-K 的 reduction + 70%+ memory)","-","-**BP4: 算子融合表达为可搜索的编码空间**（STOF 证据, score: 1637.2）","-","-Binary hash encoding 量化抽象融合方案：","-- 为每算子分配编码位，同值相邻=同一融合段","-- Minimal action set (expand/seize/compete) 覆盖所有合法变换","-- DFS + performance cache 探索方案空间","-- Reward-based 参数采样聚焦最有希望段","-","-**BP5: 根据硬件并发模型选择正确的执行范式**","-","-- GPU (H100): FlashFuser DSM fusion (GEMM chain); Kitsune dataflow (异构算子混合)","-- SambaNova SN40L: 极致 streaming fusion (整 decoder→单 kernel)","-- TPU: XLA static fusion (规则 Transformer); MoE routing 回退动态调度","-- Ascend NPU: CANN MatMul+All-to-All 融合 + 异构单元分工","-","-**BP6: 异构存储的静态分层管理**（SambaNova SN40L 证据, score: 2956.8）","-","-- 权重保留 HBM（高 temporal locality: autoregressive decoding 中每 token 读取）","-- 中间激活可 spill 到 DDR（低 BW 需求: one-shot use）","-- 编译器 static symbol lifetime GC: 区间图着色 + first-fit 分配 + peak HBM 最小化","-- 实现单节点 150 experts (>1T parameters) 部署","-"," ---"," ","-## 六、是什么？（辅助说明）","+## 五、不同硬件平台的并发模式偏好差异（主内容）"," ","-### 核心概念定义","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/.../StreamTensor/1.1-Dataflow-Architecture.md` (score: 5208.6), `knowledge_notes/.../Systolic-array Accelerator.md` (score: 3882.9), `paper_secs/.../Meta_s_Second_Generation_AI_Chip...md` (score: 920.3)"," ","-**算子排布与调度策略** 指在给定硬件计算/存储能力约束下，决定多个并发算子的执行顺序、资源分配、数据传递方式的系统方法。设计空间内：","-- **时间维度**：temporal multiplexing（vertical fusion，同 SM 上算子分时复用）vs spatial concurrency（dataflow，不同 SM 上算子空间并发）","-- **空间维度**：CTA 级（单 SM）→ Cluster 级（DSM，max 16 SM）→ Grid 级（全 GPU 多 kernel 并发）","-- **粒度维度**：粗粒度（整层/整模块）vs 细粒度（tile 级/微算子级）","+```mermaid","+flowchart TD","+    subgraph GPU_SIMT[\"GPU SIMT (NVIDIA H100)\"]","+        A1[\"HBM (80GB, 3.35TB/s)\"] --> A2[\"L2 Cache (50MB)\"]","+        A2 --> A3[\"L1/SMEM (227KB/SM)\"]","+        A3 --> A4[\"Register File (256KB/SM)\"]","+        A4 --> A5[\"Tensor Core (WGMMA, 989 TFLOPS)\"]","+        A4 --> A6[\"CUDA Core (SIMT, 60 TFLOPS)\"]","+        A5 --> A7[\"Accumulator (FP32)\"]","+        A7 --> A3","+    end"," ","-**计算与通信 Overlap** 利用硬件的异步执行能力实现计算和数据搬移的时间重叠：","-- Kitsune: 双缓冲 ring queue（L2 驻留）实现 producer-consumer pipeline","-- PROBE: split-phase P2P 传输在两个时间窗口（All-to-All 内/GEMM 内）分片进行","-- SambaNova SN40L: streaming weight load 与 computation 重叠（>85% HBM BW 利用率）","+    subgraph NPU_SA[\"NPU Systolic Array (Ascend 910B)\"]","+        B1[\"HBM (64GB)\"] --> B2[\"Global Buffer\"]","+        B2 --> B3[\"Input Buffer (128KB)\"]","+        B2 --> B4[\"Weight Buffer (78KB)\"]","+        B3 --> B5[\"Systolic Array (32x32 PE, FP16)\"]","+        B4 --> B5","+        B5 --> B6[\"Output Buffer (512KB)\"]","+        B6 --> B7[\"SIMD Vector Engine\"]","+        B7 --> B8[\"Activation Unit (SiLU/GELU)\"]","+        B8 --> B2","+    end"," ","-**显存规划（Memory Planning）** 的核心是 tensor lifecycle management：","-- FlashFuser: 贪心 spill plan——tensor 优先放 fastest memory（reg→SMEM→DSM），容量不足时逐级溢出","-- SambaNova: compiler static symbol lifetime GC——区间图着色 + 异构存储 spill (HBM vs DDR)","-- Kitsune: L2-resident queue 作为中间 tensor 的 primary storage（消除 HBM round-trip）","+    subgraph Dataflow[\"Dataflow RDU (SambaNova SN40L)\"]","+        C1[\"DDR (1.5TB, 200GB/s)\"] --> C2[\"HBM (64GB, 1.8TB/s)\"]","+        C2 --> C3[\"PMU SRAM (520MB total)\"]","+        C3 --> C4[\"PCU (Systolic/SIMD, 638 TFLOPS)\"]","+        C4 --> C5[\"RDN (On-Chip Interconnect)\"]","+        C5 --> C3","+    end","+```"," ","----","+**注解**:","+- **GPU SIMT**: 132 SMs，每 SM 128KB L1 + 227KB SMEM。Tensor Core 提供 989 TFLOPS (BF16)。动态 warp 调度自动隐藏 memory latency。适合 \"多 stream + kernel fusion\" 并发模式。","+- **NPU SA**: 32×32 PE array，weight stationary dataflow（权重预加载到 PE，inputs/outputs 流经 array）。确定性数据流——零 warp 调度开销。适合 \"GEMM systolic + SIMD vector 交替执行\" 的算子级并行。","+- **Dataflow RDU**: 1040 PCUs + 1040 PMUs。三级存储（SRAM→HBM→DDR）。硬件原生 streaming fusion——适合 \"空间 pipeline + 多 expert 并发 hosting\" 模式（DDR 存所有 experts，HBM 缓存活跃 expert，SRAM 执行当前计算）。"," ","-## 七、实现（辅助说明）","+### 各平台核心并发差异对比表"," ","-| 方法 | 实现框架 | 后端技术 | 部署方式 |","-|------|---------|---------|---------|","-| Kitsune | PyTorch Dynamo compiler | CUDA atomics + 自定义 cudaPipeline API | 编译器自动 lower + 手动 kernel 队列化 (~8 person-hours/operator) |","-| FlashFuser | CUTLASS-based compiler | TMA + mbarrier + wgmma (H100) | M-dimension binning + runtime table lookup |","-| PROBE | Python scheduler + NCCL | CUDA Stream + P2P + NCCL All-to-All | Runtime daemon 线程，控制面 offload |","-| HyTiS | Triton compiler | TMA (H100) / ldmatrix (A100) | Offline profiling + runtime 两级调度 |","-| STOF | PyTorch + Triton + TileLang | JIT ninja .so (MHA) + torch.compile (fusion) | fx.GraphModule graph capture |","-| SambaNova SN40L | SambaFlow compiler | PCU/PMU spatial mapping + AGCU | Python 框架级自动生成 fused kernel |","+| 维度 | GPU SIMT (H100) | NPU SA (Ascend 910B) | TPU SA (v5p) | Dataflow RDU (SN40L) |","+|------|-----------------|---------------------|--------------|----------------------|","+| **计算范式** | Warp-SIMT + Tensor Core | 32×32 Systolic Array | 128×128 Systolic Array | Configurable SA/SIMD |","+| **并发粒度** | Thread Block (1024 threads) | PE Array tile (m×32) | PE Array tile (m×128) | PCU-level pipeline stage |","+| **存储层次** | HBM→L2→L1/SMEM→Reg | DDR→GlobalBuf→PE Reg | HBM→VPU→MXU | DDR→HBM→PMU SRAM |","+| **算子融合** | 编译器 kernel fusion (SMEM 227KB 限制) | 编译器 layer fusion | XLA 自动融合 | 硬件原生 streaming fusion |","+| **通信 Overlap 机制** | Multi-stream + NVSHMEM + TB specialization | 专用 DMA 引擎 + AI Core/Vector 交替 | ICI (Inter-Chip Interconnect) | RDN + P2P protocol |","+| **最佳并发模式** | Kernel 内 TB specialization (Comet 风格) | 脉动流 + 向量引擎交替执行 | 大规模 systolic 批量 | 空间 streaming pipeline |","+| **关键约束** | Kernel launch overhead (~100µs) | PE array 尺寸固定 (32×32) | XLA 编译时间 | 需编译器 PnR 映射 |"," ","----","+**笔记证据**: 此表综合了 `StreamTensor/1.1-Dataflow-Architecture.md` (score: 5208.6)、`Systolic-array Accelerator.md` (score: 3882.9)、`Streaming-Dataflow...md` (score: 358.1)、`Comet...Overlapping.md` (score: 978.9) 等多条笔记。"," ","-## 八、实验环境（辅助说明）","-","-| 方法 | 硬件平台 | 模型负载 | 关键指标 |","-|------|---------|---------|----------|","-| Kitsune | NVIDIA A100 (108 SM) | DLRM, MeshGraphNets, NeRF, GraphCast, Llama 3 8B | 1.3×–2.4× speedup; 41%–98% off-chip traffic ↓ |","-| FlashFuser | NVIDIA H100 SXM | GPT-6.7B, LLaMA-1B, OPT-1.3B, BERT, GPT-2 | 3.3× vs cuBLAS; 4.1× vs SOTA compilers; 58% memory ↓ |","-| PROBE | 8×GPU cluster (推断 A100) | MoE models (Mixtral 8×7B) | 1.32× prefill ↓; 1.3× decode throughput ↑ |","-| HyTiS | H100, A100 | GEMM micro-benchmark (多维度) | Wave quantization 消除; 36%→21% 陡降消除 |","-| STOF | RTX 4090, A100 | BERT, GPT-2, LLaMA, T5, ViT | 1.8×/1.6× vs FlexAttention; 1.3×/1.4× e2e |","-| SambaNova SN40L | 8–16 SN40L sockets | Llama 2/3.1 (7B–405B), Mistral, Falcon, BLOOM | 2×–13× fusion; 85% HBM BW; 3.7× vs DGX H100 |","-| StreamTensor | FPGA (dataflow accel.) | LLM Transformer decoder | 0.76×/0.64× latency vs SOTA; 1.99× energy vs GPU |","-"," ---"," "," ## 方法对比表"," "," | 方法 | 核心机制 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |"," |------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|","-| **Kitsune** | Ring queue + 双 arbiter → BSP→Dataflow | PyTorch Dynamo + CUDA atomics | A100 | 1.3×–2.3×; 41%–98% off-chip↓ | paper_secs (12458.8) |","-| **FlashFuser** | DSM 三级 spilling + dsm_comm primitives | CUTLASS + TMA + mbarrier | H100 | 3.3× vs cuBLAS; 58% mem↓ | paper_secs (28077.6), idea (13.6) |","-| **PROBE** | Continuous Lookahead + Split-Phase P2P | Python + NCCL + CUDA Stream | 8×GPU | 1.32× prefill↓; 1.3× decode↑ | paper_secs (11001.9) |","-| **HyTiS** | 两级 tile + adaptive layout | Triton compiler | H100/A100 | Wave quantization 消除 | idea (18.0) |","-| **STOF** | Binary hash encoding + DFS/reward search | PyTorch+Triton+TileLang | RTX 4090, A100 | 1.8× vs FlexAttention; 1.4× e2e | paper_secs (1637.2) |","-| **SambaNova SN40L** | Streaming dataflow + 20+算子→单 kernel | SambaFlow + AGCU | SN40L RDU (5nm) | 2×–13×; >85% HBM BW | paper_secs (2956.8) |","-| **StreamTensor** | Iterative tensor type + 三级 DSE | FPGA compiler | FPGA | 0.76× latency; 1.99× energy | paper_secs (11343.7) |","-| **Stratum NMP Ring** | Bidirectional ring + in-situ aggregator | NMP logic die | 16 PU ring | 2.048 TB/s ring BW | knowledge (615.5) |","+| **Nimble** | AoT CUDA Graph + 自动 multi-stream DAG 并行化 | PyTorch + CUDA Graph API | V100/A100/H100 | vs PyTorch up to 22.34×, max concurrency=15 | idea_notes/Nimble (967.6) |","+| **MPK (Mirage)** | In-kernel parallel runtime: SM 分区 + event-driven + cross-task pipelining | torch.compile(backend=MPK) | A100/H100/B200 | 12.5ms/token (下限~10ms), 1.2-1.3× speedup | experiment_notes/Mirage (243.4) |","+| **Comet** | Shared tensor decomposition + tile reordering + TB specialization | CUTLASS + NVSHMEM + Megatron | H800/L20 | Hide 86.5% comm, 1.96× single-layer, 1.71× E2E | idea_notes/Comet (1008.6), experiment_notes/Comet (978.9) |","+| **Lancet** | Whole-graph partition + stage pipeline scheduling | Tutel + NCCL + RAF | A100/V100 多节点 | 通信-计算重叠覆盖率分析 | experiment_notes/Lancet (1158.1) |","+| **Welder** | Tile-graph + tile propagation + traffic cost model | ONNX + tile-graph compiler | V100/A100 | DRAM traffic 节省 69%, 89 种 fusion pattern | idea_notes/Welder (939.5) |","+| **FlashFuser** | DSM-based cluster-level fusion + dsm_comm primitives | CUTLASS + CUDA 12.4 | H100 SXM | vs Chimera 4.1×, HBM access -58% | experiment_notes/FlashFuser (656.5) |","+| **SCAR** | Heterogeneous chiplet scheduling: spatial locality + dataflow matching | Custom scheduler | MCM accelerator (sim) | O(10^56)→sec-level search | paper_secs/SCAR (2159.0) |","+| **PROBE** | Hardware-aware greedy planning: T_window + water-filling | NVSHMEM + single-SM kernel | H100/H800 | Planning hidden by MoE compute | knowledge_notes/Hardware-Aware (271.3) |","+| **SN40L Streaming** | 硬件原生 streaming dataflow: PCU SA/SIMD + PMU composable mem | SambaFlow compiler | SN40L RDU (5nm) | 520MB SRAM + 64GB HBM + 1.5TB DDR | paper_secs/SambaNova (358.1) |","+| **ParallelKittens** | LCSC 模板: Intra-SM / Inter-SM overlapping + 8 通信原语 | ThunderKittens + CUDA | H100 (NVLink) | TMA + warp spec + 预分配缓冲区 | idea_notes/ParallelKittens (300.5) |"," "," ---"," "," ## 不确定性"," ","-1. **华为 Ascend 910B CANN 融合细节缺失**：Expert-Token Resonance idea note 提及 CANN MatMul+All-to-All 融合，但明确标注 \"论文未详细说明 CANN 版本或融合策略细节\"。910B 的 Da Vinci 架构细节（Cube/Vector/AI CPU 并发能力）在 vault 中无专门 paper_secs——此处标记为「笔记未明确说明」。","-2. **Apple Neural Engine (ANE) 笔记完全缺失**：vault 未搜索到任何 ANE 架构笔记或论文 section，ANE 在多算子并发优化中的位置无法评估。","-3. **Google TPU v5e/v5p 并发细节不完整**：SambaNova 论文 Related Work 和 StreamTensor 论文提及 TPU，但 vault 中无 TPU 并发模式（XLA fusion pass 序列、ICI 调度策略、buffer allocation 算法）的专门笔记。","-4. **Video 模型的时空算子并发覆盖不足**：搜索命中主要集中在 MoE/LLM/Transformer 算子并发，Video-specific 的 spatial-temporal stream 并行编排在 vault 中缺少专门论文——标记为「笔记覆盖缺口」。","-5. **Groq LPU / Cerebras CS-3 细节**：vault 仅有间接引用（ELK/StreamTensor/SambaNova 论文 Related Work），无专门笔记或论文 section。","-6. **Memory planning 的形式化方法缺乏专门论文**：FlashFuser 的 dataflow analyzer 提供了 spilling 算法，SambaNova 提供了 static lifetime GC，但更 formal 的 tensor lifecycle optimization（如 recomputation/rematerialization 与并发的关系）在现有笔记中未见系统讨论——「可推断但笔记未明确定量」。","-7. **FP8/INT4 量化对算子融合影响**：笔记中 DMQ (score: 401.4) 涉及 Diffusion Model 量化但对量化如何与算子融合交互——如 FP8 GEMM 的 tile 约束差异、量化对 intermediate tensor size 的影响——笔记未明确说明。","+1. **NPU/TPU 的具体并发原语细节**：笔记中对华为昇腾 Ascend NPU 和 Google TPU 的算子级并发机制描述有限，主要来自 `Systolic-array Accelerator.md` (score: 3882.9) 和 `Streaming-Dataflow...md` (score: 358.1) 的知识笔记推断。笔记未明确说明 CANN 的算子级并发 API 和 Ascend 910B 的片上网络拓扑细节。","+2. **Lancet 在单 GPU 单请求场景的适用性**：Lancet 笔记主要覆盖多 GPU 训练场景的 whole-graph pipeline，在单 GPU 单请求推理场景下的适用性笔记未明确说明，标记为 \"可推断\"。","+3. **FlashFuser DSM capacity 与 cluster size 的精确关系**：笔记显示 DSM bandwidth 随 cluster size 变化但 DSM 总可用容量与 cluster 内 SM 数量的定量关系笔记未明确给出。","+4. **不同硬件平台对比的验证**：基于笔记内容跨硬件平台推断最佳实践映射，但部分对比（如 TPU v5p 的具体算子融合策略）笔记未直接验证。"," "," ---"," ","-[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L1-Q1.6","+[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q1.6-L1"]}],"originalFile":"# Q1.6 — 面向硬件体系结构的多算子并发优化：算法层面的设计空间与最佳实践\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashFuser.../FlashFuser-Expanding-the-Scale-of-Kernel-Fusion...md | 28077.6 | DSM-based kernel fusion，三级 memory hierarchy（reg→SMEM→DSM），dataflow analyzer + 搜索剪枝 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Kitsune.../Kitsune-Enabling-Dataflow-Execution-on-GPUs.md | 12458.8 | GPU dataflow 执行：ring queue + 双 arbiter grid scheduler，空间并发替代 temporal multiplexing |\n| paper_secs/secs_2025/11-StreamTensor.../StreamTensor-Make-Tensors-Stream...md | 11343.7 | Dataflow 加速器编译器：迭代 tensor type system，三级设计空间搜索（tiling/fusion/resource） |\n| paper_secs/secs_moe/PROBE.../PROBE-CO-BALANCING...md | 11001.9 | Continuous Lookahead Pipelining: predictor + balance planner + split-phase co-scheduling |\n| paper_secs/secs_2025/8-SambaNova_SN40L.../VI.-CASE-STUDIES.md | 2956.8 | Operator fusion impact: 2×–13× speedup；CoE 部署；三阶梯存储 streaming dataflow |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/26-Accelerating Sparse Transformer.../4-Methodology.md | 1637.2 | STOF: binary hash encoding fusion + DFS/reward search，sparse MHA + dense downstream fusion |\n| idea_notes/FlashFuser_ Expanding the Scale of Kernel Fusion...md | 13.6 | Idea 分析：baseline 缺陷（SMEM 瓶颈/忽略 DSM/单一 tiling/搜索爆炸），DSM-aware 全栈方案 |\n| idea_notes/HyTiS_ Hybrid Tile Scheduling for GPU GEMM...md | 18.0 | 两级 tile 调度消除 wave quantization；architecture-aware profiling + adaptive layout |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/On-Chip Ring Network for NMP...md | 615.5 | NMP 环形网络：all-gather/reduce-scatter/scalar exchange + in-situ aggregator |\n| paper_secs/secs_2025/48-Meta_s Second Generation AI Chip...md | 920.3 | MTIA 2i: 8×8 PE array, NoC, model-chip co-design，44% TCO 降低 |\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节（主内容）：算子排布与调度策略\n\n### 方法1：Kitsune — GPU 上的 Dataflow 执行模型\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Kitsune Enabling Dataflow Execution on GPUs/Kitsune-Enabling-Dataflow-Execution-on-GPUs.md` (score: 12458.8)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nKitsune（NVIDIA, 2025）探索了在现有 GPU 架构上通过最小硬件改动实现 synchronous dataflow 执行的可行性。其核心洞察：GPU 的 BSP 执行模型与 DL 的 DAG 图结构存在根本性 mismatch——大量时间 SM 和 DRAM 利用率均低于 33%（Nsight Compute 实测）。Kitsune 通过两个互补的软件-硬件原语将 BSP 转换为 dataflow：(1) 基于 GPU atomics 的 L2-resident ring queue 实现 inter-CTA 通信；(2) 修改 Grid Scheduler 为双 arbiter（SIMT/TENSOR 类型）实现异构 CTA 在同一 SM 上的空间并发。\n\n**方法细节（达到 L1 算法粒度的伪代码）**：\n\n```\n算法: Kitsune Spatial Pipeline Construction\n输入: DL 计算子图 G = (V, E)，算子类型映射 type: V → {TENSOR, SIMT}\n输出: 空间流水线计划 plan = (stages, queues, cta_assignment)\n\n1  function BuildSpatialPipeline(G):\n2      // Step 1: 子图选择（基于模式匹配）\n3      // 匹配三种关键模式:\n4      //   (a) MLP: Linear(dim→hidden) → Activation → Linear(hidden→dim)\n5      //       中间 tensor shape: [B, hidden], hidden ≥ 768 时超 SMEM\n6      //   (b) Reduce: 多 GEMM partial sums → Elementwise Reduce\n7      //   (c) Multicast: Elementwise → {GEMM₁, GEMM₂}\n8      sf_nodes ← PatternMatch(G, pattern_library)\n9      \n10     // Step 2: 流水线设计（插入队列节点）\n11     for each sf_node in sf_nodes:\n12         for each edge (opᵢ → opⱼ) in sf_node:\n13             if IsReduction(edge):\n14                 // 归约模式: many-to-one，构建归约树\n15                 queue ← CreateReductionQueue(arity=N_producers)\n16             elif IsMulticast(edge):\n17                 // 多播模式: one-to-many\n18                 queue ← CreateMulticastQueue(fanout=N_consumers)\n19             else:\n20                 // 标准模式: one-to-one，双缓冲 ring queue\n21                 queue ← CreateRingQueue(capacity=2, payload=64KB)\n22             sf_node.replace_edge(edge, queue)\n23     \n24     // Step 3: CTA 资源分配\n25     for each stage in sf_node.stages:\n26         stage.cta_type ← type[stage.operator]\n27         // Input shape: [M, K]; Weight: [K, N]\n28         // Tile shape: Tₘ × Tₖ × Tₙ = 128 × 64 × 128 (FP16)\n29         stage.num_ctas ← ceil(M/Tₘ) × ceil(N/Tₙ)\n30     \n31     // Step 4: cudaPipeline launch（新增 API）\n32     cudaPipelineLaunch(\n33         kernels   = [k₀, k₁, ..., k_N],         // 每 stage 一个 kernel\n34         dep_graph = queue_dag,                   // 队列数据依赖图\n35         type_hint = [TENSOR, SIMT, TENSOR, ...], // 资源类型标注\n36     )\n37     // Grid Scheduler (双 arbiter 硬件改动):\n38     //   - TENSOR arbiter: 将 GEMM CTA 分配到有空闲 Tensor Core 的 SM\n39     //   - SIMT arbiter:  将 Elementwise CTA 分配到有空闲 CUDA Core 的 SM\n40     //   - 同一 SM 可同时容纳 TENSOR_CTA × 1 + SIMT_CTA × 1\n41     return plan\n```\n\n**Kitsune Ring Queue 核心原语**（L2 驻留，per-entry cache-line padded）：\n\n```\n// 数据结构\nstruct QueueEntry {\n    uint32_t seq_num;          // 原子序列号（同步元数据）\n    float    payload[16384];   // 64KB tile 数据（FP32 = 16K floats）\n}; // sizeof = 64KB + 4B, padded to cache-line boundary\n\n// Producer 端\nvoid producer_acquire(Queue* q, QueueEntry** entry):\n    wr ← atomicAdd(&q->write_seq, 1)\n    *entry ← &q->entries[wr % q->capacity]\n    while (*entry->seq_num != wr - q->capacity + 1):  // spin-wait\n        continue\n\nvoid producer_release(Queue* q):\n    __syncthreads()              // CTA 内屏障: 确保所有线程完成写入\n    if threadIdx.x == 0:\n        q->entries[wr % capacity].seq_num ← wr  // 原子标记已填充\n\n// Consumer 端（对称设计）\nvoid consumer_acquire(Queue* q, QueueEntry** entry):\n    rd ← atomicAdd(&q->read_seq, 1)\n    *entry ← &q->entries[rd % q->capacity]\n    while *entry->seq_num != rd:\n        continue\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **变量含义**：`write_seq`/`read_seq` 为全局原子计数器，实现无锁 producer-consumer 同步。`payload` 大小 (64KB) 是权衡结果——更小则原子操作 overhead 占比高（1KB 时 12× bandwidth reduction），更大则超出 L2 capacity 导致 HBM spill（256KB 以上性能下降）\n- **复杂度分析**：单 CTA 可维持 100M atomics/sec，每队列上限带宽 385–1541 GB/s（远超 L2 和 HBM 带宽）。54 队列（对应 108 CTAs for A100's 108 SMs）时 aggregate bandwidth 达 2 TB/s\n- **数据依赖**：Producer 必须先完成 tile 计算并 release 后，consumer 才能 acquire——形成 fine-grained pipeline synchronization。多播模式下一个 producer 可 feed 多个 consumer queues\n- **并发可行性**：TENSOR 和 SIMT 类型 CTA 可在同一 SM 空间并发——Tensor Core 执行 GEMM tile 时，CUDA Core 同时执行 elementwise 操作。这解决了 vertical fusion 中的 temporal multiplexing 闲置问题（同一时刻仅 Tensor Core 或 SIMT Core 之一活跃）\n\n**实验环境**：NVIDIA A100 GPU (108 SM, 192KB SMEM/SM, 40GB HBM)；评估 DLRM、MeshGraphNets、NeRF、GraphCast、Llama 3 8B（推理+训练）五个应用。Kitsune 推理加速 1.3×–2.3×，训练加速 1.1×–2.4×，off-chip traffic 减少 41%–98%（推理）/ 16%–42%（训练）。硬件 synergy 实验：当 on-chip compute 和 L2 bandwidth 翻倍而 HBM bandwidth 不变时，Kitsune 实现 47%（推理）和 27%（训练）额外加速，baseline 仅 18%–26%。\n\n---\n\n### 方法2：HyTiS — 面向 GEMM Wave Utilization 的混合 Tile 调度\n\n**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/HyTiS_ Hybrid Tile Scheduling for GPU GEMM with Enhanced Wave Utilization and Cache Locality.md` (score: 18.0)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nHyTiS 针对 GPU GEMM 的 **wave quantization** 问题：当 output tile 数量不能被 SM 数量整除时，最后一个 partial wave 中大量 SM 闲置。例如 1672×1024 GEMM 在 128×128 tile 下产生 112 tiles（< 132 SM），SM 利用率仅 85%。HyTiS 通过两级联混合 tile 调度解决——full waves 用大 tile（吞吐导向），partial wave 用小 tile（延迟导向），零额外同步开销。\n\n**方法细节（达到 L1 粒度的调度算法）**：\n\n```\n算法: HyTiS Two-Level Cascaded Scheduling\n输入: GEMM dims (M, N, K), GPU spec (N_SM, SMEM_cap)\n输出: 最优配置 (K1_full_wave, K2_partial, layout)\n\n1  function HyTiSSchedule(M, N, K, GPU):\n2      // Phase 1: Offline Profiling（≈19 min on H100）\n3      C_TO ← ProfileAllTiles(GPU, constraint={\n4          SMEM ≤ SMEM_cap,    // SMEM 不溢出\n5          REG_spill == 0,      // 寄存器不 spill\n6          bM % 64 == 0,        // H100 wgmma 对齐约束\n7          one_tile_per_SM       // tile 足够大以有效利用 SMEM BW\n8      })\n9      // 按性能 top-15% 阈值保留候选\n10     S_TO ← TopPercentile(C_TO, p=0.15)   // 吞吐导向: e.g. 128×128×64\n11     S_LO ← TopPercentile(C_TO, p=0.15)   // 延迟导向: e.g. 64×64×32\n12     \n13     // Phase 2: Runtime 两级调度\n14     N_TO ← ceil(M/bM_TO) × ceil(N/bN_TO)\n15     N_LO ← ceil(M/bM_LO) × ceil(N/bN_LO)\n16     \n17     if N_TO ≥ N_SM:\n18         // Case A: 至少 1 个 full wave\n19         //   K1=large tile 处理 full waves → 保吞吐\n20         //   K2=small tile 处理 partial wave → 降延迟\n21         N_remain ← N_TO % N_SM\n22         K2 ← SelectBest(S_LO, constraint={N_LO ≈ N_remain})\n23     else:\n24         // Case B: 全部 partial wave → LO-only scheduling\n25         K2 ← SelectBest(S_LO, constraint={N_LO 最大化 SM 利用})\n26         K1 ← None\n27     \n28     // Phase 3: Adaptive Tile Layout（GM vs GN）\n29     // 最小化 wave 级 DRAM→L2 流量\n30     s_opt_GM ← min(ceil(√(N_SM × bN/bM)), ceil(M/bM))\n31     V_GM ← ComputeDRAMTraffic(layout=GM, group=s_opt_GM)\n32     V_GN ← ComputeDRAMTraffic(layout=GN, group=...)\n33     layout ← (V_GM < V_GN) ? GM : GN\n34     \n35     return (K1, K2, layout)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **Wave quantization** 是 GEMM 在 GPU 上的普遍问题——tile count 与 SM count 的除余导致 partial wave SM 浪费。HyTiS 的两级 tile 方案无需沿 K 维拆分（Split-K）或 Stream-K 风格的 reduction sync——零同步开销\n- **Architecture-aware 约束**：H100 wgmma 指令要求 bM%64==0（Tensor Core warp group MMA 对齐），bM/bN 选择受 SMEM 容量硬约束（≤227KB/SM）\n- **Layout 自适应**：group-M (GM) vs group-N (GN) 布局选择影响 L2 cache hit rate——同一 wave 内相邻 SM 访问相同 A/B tile 从 L2 命中。实测 DRAM read 从 46%（低效布局）降至 20%（最优布局）\n- **对比 Split-K**：Split-K 额外消耗 70%+ device memory（workspace allocation），而 HyTiS 零额外内存\n\n**实验环境**：NVIDIA H100 GPU，Triton compiler 后端。Offline profiling ~19 min；runtime 调度开销可忽略。\n\n---\n\n### 方法3：STOF — 面向 Sparse Transformer 的融合调度搜索\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/26-Accelerating Sparse Transformer Inference on GPU/4-Methodology.md` (score: 1637.2)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nSTOF 提出用 binary hash encoding 将算子融合方案表达为可搜索空间，结合 DFS 扩展 + reward-based 参数采样的两级搜索，自动发现最优融合边界和 kernel 参数。核心设计：将 Transformer 分为 MHA（手动优化 kernel）和 downstream dense operators（自动融合搜索）两部分，通过 co-design 实现互补。\n\n**方法细节（融合方案编码与搜索伪代码）**：\n\n```\n算法: STOF Fusion Scheme Conversion & Hierarchical Search\n输入: DL 计算图 G，融合模板库 T\n输出: 最优方案 scheme* + 参数 params*\n\n1  function FusionConversion(G, T):\n2      // Step 1: Binary Hash Encoding\n3      // 算子序列: [MHA, LN, GEMM₁, GELU, GEMM₂, Dropout, Residual, LN]\n4      // hash code: [0,    0,   1,      1,     1,     1,       0,       0]\n5      // → 3 个 fused segments: {MHA+LN}, {GEMM₁+GELU+GEMM₂+Dropout}, {Residual+LN}\n6      scheme ← NumericEncode(G)  // 相邻同数字 = 同一融合段\n7      \n8      // Step 2: DFS Fusion Boundary Expansion (Stage 1)\n9      for each segment in scheme:\n10         for action in [expand, seize, compete]:\n11             // expand: 合并相邻段（如将独立 BiasAdd 融入 GEMM chain）\n12             // seize:  CI 段抢占 MI-only 段的算子\n13             // compete: 两个 CI 段竞争独立算子→优先扩展仅 1 个 CI 的段\n14             new_scheme ← ApplyAction(scheme, segment, action)\n15             if Profile(new_scheme, K=5) > Profile(scheme, K=5):\n16                 scheme ← new_scheme   // 接受扩展\n17             else:\n18                 rollback\n19             // 约束: 每段最多 2 个 CI (compute-intensive) 算子\n20     \n21     // Step 3: Reward-Based Parameter Sampling (Stage 2)\n22     for iter in 1..MAX_ITER:\n23         for each segment in scheme:\n24             n_samples ← base + (segment==best_gain ? reward_bonus : 0)\n25             params ← RandomSample(segment.param_space, n_samples)\n26             best_params[segment] ← argmax(Profile(segment, p) for p in params)\n27         if converged: break\n28     \n29     return (scheme, best_params)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **Binary hash encoding** 将抽象融合模式量化为可枚举空间——类比数字电路高低电平。编码长度=算子数，相邻同值=合并。支持双向映射（hash↑/decode↓），与\"hash\"定义一致\n- **DFS 三规则**：expand（合并相邻段不变其他）、seize（CI 段从 MI 段\"抢占\"算子）、compete（两段竞争时扩展只有 1 个 CI 的段）——覆盖所有合法 scheme 变换\n- **Reward-based sampling**：每迭代固定总配置数，最高增益段获双倍采样配额——搜索效率比均匀采样高 6.7×\n- **两层分工**：MHA 使用手动优化 kernel（利用 mask sparsity 跳过无效计算），downstream 使用自动融合（灵活组合 GEMM/Activation/Dropout 等）——避免破坏 MHA 的精细优化\n\n**实验环境**：NVIDIA RTX 4090 (Ada) 和 A100 (Ampere)；PyTorch + Triton + TileLang 实现（~5000 LOC Python + ~2500 LOC C/CUDA）。BERT/LLaMA/GPT-2/T5/ViT 模型。STOF vs FlexAttention: 1.8×/1.6× MHA 加速（RTX 4090/A100）；end-to-end vs PyTorch Compile: 1.3×/1.4×。\n\n---\n\n## 二、方法细节（主内容）：计算与通信 Overlap 的算法设计\n\n### 方法4：PROBE — MoE 推理的 Continuous Lookahead Pipelining\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/PROBE Co-Balancing Computation and Communication in MoE Inference via Real-Time Predictive Prefetching/PROBE-CO-BALANCING-COMPUTATION-AND-COMMUNICATION-IN-MOE-INFERENCE-VIA-REAL-TIME-PREDICTIVE-PREFETCHING.md` (score: 11001.9)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nPROBE 引入 Continuous Lookahead Pipelining 范式，解决 MoE 推理中的\"双重惩罚\"——计算偏斜（expert 热点集中导致 GPU 间计算不均）与网络拥塞（All-to-All 通信在热点 GPU 堆积）相互耦合放大。核心创新：利用当前层的执行时间预测、规划、预取下一层 expert 权重，将控制面决策完全移出关键路径。\n\n**方法细节（达到 L1 算法粒度的伪代码与时序图）**：\n\n```\n算法: PROBE Phase-Locked Co-Scheduling\n输入: MoE 模型层 L[0..D], GPU 集群 G[0..N-1]\n输出: 每层方案 plan[l] = (expert_placement, token_assignment, tx_schedule)\n\n1  function PROBE_ContinuousLookahead(G, L):\n2      // 初始化: Gate-Initialized Lookahead Predictor\n3      predictor ← DistillRouter(L.target_router)\n4          // 以 target router 权重初始化, 轻量 NN 蒸馏\n5          // 预测下一层 expert 激活 (fidelity > 0.9 top-2)\n6      \n7      for l in 0..D-1:\n8          // === Track A: 主执行流 ===\n9          tokens_gpu ← AllToAllDispatch(tokens, plan[l])\n10         GEMM_Expert(tokens_gpu, plan[l].local_experts)\n11         tokens ← AllToAllCombine(outputs)\n12         Attention(tokens)\n13         \n14         // === Track B: 控制面（与主执行流并行） ===\n15         // 预测（与 All-to-All 并行: network-bound, SM 闲置）\n16         async:\n17             n̂[l+1] ← predictor.Predict(current_tokens, l+1)\n18         \n19         // 规划（与 GEMM 并行: compute-bound, 网络闲置）\n20         async:\n21             plan[l+1] ← BalancePlanning(n̂[l+1], G, {\n22                 hiding_window: T_GEMM[l],     // GEMM 执行时间窗口\n23                 max_replicas: 3,              // 每 expert 最多 3 副本\n24                 BW_NVLink: 900 GB/s           // NVLink 双向带宽\n25             })\n26         \n27         // 预取（与 GEMM 并行: split-phase 避免竞争 All-to-All 带宽）\n28         async:\n29             for (expert, src, dst) in plan[l+1].moves:\n30                 // 前半段: GEMM 计算期间 P2P 传输\n31                 GPU_P2P_Send(expert.weights[0:HALF], src→dst)\n32                 // 等待 All-to-All 完成...\n33                 // 后半段: 下一个 All-to-All 期间传输\n34                 GPU_P2P_Send(expert.weights[HALF:END], src→dst)\n35     \n36     return plan\n\n// === Balance Planning Greedy Solver ===\n37  function BalancePlanning(n̂, G, constraints):\n38      // Water-filling 算法: 迭代将 bottleneck rank 的 heaviest expert\n39      // 复制到 earliest-idle helper rank\n40      L[r] ← T_comp(n̂[r]) + T_comm(n̂[r])  for r in 0..N-1\n41      for k = 1 to K_max (=16):\n42          r_src ← argmax_r L[r]\n43          r_dst ← argmin_r L[r]\n44          e* ← heaviest_expert_on(r_src)\n45          T_trans ← (size(e*) × n_tokens(e*, r_src→r_dst)) / BW_NVLink\n46          if T_trans ≤ min(T_window[r_src], T_window[r_dst]):\n47              Δ ← min(excess(r_src, e*), capacity(r_dst))\n48              A[r_src→r_dst, e*] += Δ\n49              update L[r_src], L[r_dst]\n50          if gain ≤ ε: break\n51      return (expert_replicas, A)\n```\n\n**Split-Phase Transmission 时序图**：\n\n```\n层 l 执行时间线 (单 GPU 视角):\n|←—————————————————— T_layer[l] —————————————————————→|\n| All-to-All  |    GEMM(expert)     | All-to-All | Attn |\n|  (dispatch) |                     | (combine)  |      |\n|             |←—— hiding_window ——→|            |      |\n|             | P2P Prefetch 前半段  | P2P 后半段  |      |\n|             | (expert weights 0:½) | (½:end)    |      |\n| Predictor   | Balance Planner     |            |      |\n| (下一层)    | (下一层)            |            |      |\n\n资源利用互补:\n  All-to-All → network-bound, SM 闲置    → 运行 Predictor\n  GEMM       → compute-bound, 网络闲置  → 运行 Planner + P2P 传输\n  Attention  → memory-bound, 两者均有闲置 → 下一层预测开始\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **变量含义**：`n̂[l+1]` 由 Lookahead Predictor 提前一层预测（fidelity > 0.9 top-2 命中率），基于当前层 gating logits。`hiding_window` 是硬件 profiler 静态获取的 GEMM 执行时间——P2P 传输必须在此窗口内完成\n- **Split-phase 核心洞察**：expert weight P2P transfer 与 All-to-All collective 共享 NVLink 物理链路——两者不应同时进行（带宽竞争）→ 前半段在 GEMM 期间（避开 All-to-All），后半段在下一个 All-to-All 期间（此时网络有闲置容量）\n- **Balance Planning**：Greedy solver 在严格 hiding-window 约束下最小化 max(token_per_gpu) + λ·max(expert_copies)。λ 平衡计算均衡与通信 overhead\n- **并发可行性**：控制面三个环节（predict/plan/prefetch）均与主执行流不同阶段并发——利用硬件资源使用互补特性（network vs compute vs memory bandwidth）\n\n**实验环境**：8×A100 GPU cluster（笔记推断），MoE 模型（Mixtral 8×7B 等）。PROBE 降低 prefill latency 最高 1.32×，提升 decode throughput 最高 1.3×。Predictor fidelity > 0.9。\n\n---\n\n### 方法5：Stratum NMP — 环形网络上的通信-计算 Overlap\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/On-Chip Ring Network for NMP (近存计算片上环形网络).md` (score: 615.5)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nStratum NMP logic die 上的 bidirectional ring network 连接 16 个 Processing Units (PUs)，通过三种集体通信模式（all-gather / reduce-scatter / scalar exchange）支持 MoE 推理的通信-计算 overlap。Ring router 内置 in-situ aggregator——数据流经时直接执行 element-wise add 完成归约，无需\"先存后算\"。\n\n**方法细节（MoE Expert 处理流水线中的 Overlap）**：\n\n```\nExpert 处理流水线中的通信-计算 Overlap:\n\n时间 →\n[GeMM₁] ←— 使用 all-gathered 输入\n  |→ Ring All-Gather (输入 token 分片→全复制, 128 GB/s per link)\n[GeMM₂] \n  |→ Ring Reduce-Scatter (partial outputs in-flight 累加→分片输出)\n         |→ 与下一 expert 的 GeMM₁ 并行 (overlap optimization)\n[GeMM₃] ←— 使用 reduce-scattered 输入\n\nRing Network 三种通信模式及与计算的 Overlap:\n1. All-Gather:\n   - 数据流: PUᵢ 持有 token 分片 → ring 传播到所有 PUs\n   - Overlap: 部分数据到达即可开始 GeMM₁（streaming all-gather）\n   - Per-link BW: 128 GB/s, 总聚合 BW: 2.048 TB/s\n\n2. Reduce-Scatter:\n   - 数据流: 各 PU 产生 partial output → ring 传递并累加\n   - Aggregator: in-flight element-wise add (零额外延迟)\n   - Overlap: 与下一 expert GeMM₁ 可流水线化\n\n3. Scalar Exchange (Attention Softmax):\n   - 数据流: 仅传输 local max/sum 标量值 (极小 BW)\n   - Overlap: 无需求（标量传输延迟可忽略）\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **Ring vs Crossbar**：Ring 物理设计简单（每 PU 仅 2 neighbor ports），scalability 好（增加 PU 不增加 per-PU 互联复杂度），但 all-gather 需 log(N) 步——通过通信-计算 overlap 隐藏 ring 延迟\n- **In-situ reduction**：aggregator 在数据流经 router 时直接累加——消除 \"store → load → compute\" 的冗余数据搬移。借鉴 systolic array 的 data stationary 思想和 Google TPU 的 ring-based reduce 设计\n- **仅 NMP mode 激活**：regular memory mode 下 ring network inactive 以省电\n- **通信模式与 overlap 关系**：All-Gather 与 GeMM₂ 可流水线化（部分数据到达即开始计算）；Reduce-Scatter 与下一 expert 的 GeMM₁ 可 overlap\n\n**涉及论文**：Stratum: System-Hardware Co-Design with Tiered Monolithic 3D-Stackable DRAM for Efficient MoE Serving\n\n---\n\n## 三、方法细节（主内容）：Memory Planning 与算子融合设计\n\n### 方法6：FlashFuser — 基于 DSM 的大规模 Kernel Fusion + 三级 Memory Spilling\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashFuser Expanding the Scale of Kernel Fusion for Compute-Intensive Operators via Inter-Core Connection/FlashFuser-Expanding-the-Scale-of-Kernel-Fusion-for-Compute-Intensive-Operators-via-Inter-Core-Connection.md` (score: 28077.6) 和 `idea_notes/FlashFuser_ Expanding the Scale of Kernel Fusion...md` (score: 13.6)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nFlashFuser 是首个利用 H100 Distributed Shared Memory (DSM) 进行 kernel fusion 的 DL compiler。核心突破：将算子融合的中间 tensor 存储层级从 reg→SMEM 扩展到 reg→SMEM→DSM 三级，突破单 SM 227KB SMEM 的硬限制。当中间 tensor（如 FFN 的 C ∈ R^{128×16384} ≈ 4.2MB FP16）远超 SMEM 容量时，不再回退到 HBM round-trip，而是通过 dsm_comm primitives 将数据 spill 到 cluster 内多 SM 的 DSM 池（~8 TB/s BW, ~20ns latency vs HBM 3.35 TB/s, ~280ns）。\n\n**方法细节（达到 L1 算法粒度的 Dataflow Analyzer 伪代码）**：\n\n```\n算法: FlashFuser Dataflow Analyzer（三级 Memory Spilling）\n输入: 计算图 g, 设备 d, 循环调度 s, tile 大小 t, 资源映射 r\n输出: 数据搬移量 D_V, 最终计划 p_final\n\n1  function DataflowAnalyzer(g, d, s, t, r):\n2      mapping_plan ← new ResourceMapping()\n3      D_V ← 0\n4      hierarchy ← d.getMemoryHierarchy()\n5          // [reg (256KB/SM), SMEM (227KB/SM), \n6          //  DSM (cluster 内多 SM 聚合, BW ~8TB/s for cluster=2)]\n7      S ← g.getDimensionSizes()  // {M, N, K, L}\n8      \n9      foreach tensor in g.tensors():\n10         DF ← GetFootprint(t.block)     // 单 tile 数据 footprint\n11         \n12         if tensor ∈ g.IOTensors():\n13             // IO tensor: 计算 global memory 总数据搬移\n14             DM ← DF\n15             foreach s_i in reversed(s):\n16                 if s_i accesses tensor:\n17                     DM ← DM × ceil(S_i / t_i.block)\n18             D_V[global] ← D_V[global] + DM\n19         else:\n20             // Reused tensor: 贪心 spill plan\n21             remaining ← DF\n22             mapping ← new TensorMapping()\n23             \n24             foreach level in [reg, SMEM, DSM]:\n25                 if remaining ≤ 0: break\n26                 alloc ← min(remaining, level.capacity)\n27                 mapping[level] ← alloc\n28                 remaining ← remaining - alloc\n29                 // 计算该层数据搬移量\n30                 // DSM traffic 是分析重点（BW 低于 SMEM，高于 HBM）\n31                 foreach s_i in reversed(s):\n32                     if s_i accesses tensor:\n33                         D_V[level] ← update_dv(t_i.cluster, DF)\n34             \n35             mapping_plan[tensor] ← mapping\n36     \n37     p_final ← (s, t, mapping_plan)\n38     return (D_V, p_final)\n```\n\n**DSM Communication Primitives 形式化定义**：\n\n```\n// dsm_comm 三原语\ndsm_all_exchange:\n  功能: cluster 内 AllReduce (标准 FFN) 或 element-wise Mul (Gated FFN with SiLU)\n  参数: cls_k — K 维度的 spatial partition 数量\n  示例: cls_k=2 → 2 Blocks 各算 partial C → DSM exchange + accumulate → \n        各 Block 持有完整 C tile\n  BW: ~8 TB/s (cluster_size=2), latency ~20ns\n\ndsm_shuffle:\n  功能: Shuffle Group 内 ring communication 重分布数据\n  参数: cls_shuffle = cls_l / cls_k\n  示例: cls_shuffle=2 → 2 Blocks 在 ring 上交换各自 C tile row slices\n  用途: GEMM₁ 阶段各 Block 需要 C 的不同 row slice 作为输入\n\ndsm_reduce_scatter:\n  功能: 两级 hierarchical reduction\n  参数: cls_reduce = (cls_n × cls_k) / cls_l\n  数据流: intra-cluster reduce (DSM) → inter-cluster reduce (TMA cp.reduce.async.bulk)\n  用途: Store phase 合并各 Block 的 partial output E\n```\n\n**Gated FFN (SwiGLU) 的两种 DSM Mapping 策略**：\n\n```\n策略 A: Spatial Partitioning (最大化并行度)\n  - cls_k=2: 两个 parallel GEMM branches (Up+Gate) 分配不同 Block 组\n  - dsm_all_exchange 执行 element-wise Mul (SiLU × Linear)\n  - 适用: 大 batch, cluster 内 Block 充足\n\n策略 B: Sequential Execution (最小化 DSM 通信)\n  - K-dim 加倍, 两 GEMM 在同一 Block 内顺序执行\n  - 适用: 小 batch, DSM BW 为瓶颈\n\n两种策略由 cost model 自动选择——体现 DSM-based fusion 的配置灵活性\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **DSM 性能特征**：cluster size 2 时 DSM BW ~8 TB/s（2.4× HBM），latency ~20ns（1/14× HBM）。但随 cluster size 增大 BW 下降、latency 上升——需 cost model 精确建模 cluster size 对 DSM BW 的影响\n- **Pruning 效果**：原始空间 ~2.75×10^13 → 5 条规则剪枝 → ~1.15×10^6（>99.99% 缩减）。5 条规则：Divisible Tile, Cluster Size ≤ 16, Activation=innermost loop, Dependency≠spatial L, Memory Capacity\n- **Cost Model**：min-max formulation C = max_l(V_l/B_l)，识别 bottleneck 段 → Top-K=11 硬件 profiling（搜索加速 12–68× vs brute-force）\n- **全局显存访问减少 58%**（Nsight Compute 实测），kernel speedup 3.3× vs cuBLAS，4.1× vs SOTA compilers，end-to-end 1.24×\n\n**实验环境**：NVIDIA H100 SXM GPU；GPT-6.7B/LLaMA-1B/OPT-1.3B/BERT/GPT-2；CUTLASS-based fused kernel 生成；M-dimension binning + runtime table lookup。\n\n---\n\n### 方法7：SambaNova SN40L — Streaming Dataflow 的极致算子融合\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2025/8-SambaNova_SN40L_Scaling_the_AI_Memory_Wall_with_Dataflow_and_Composition_of_Experts/VI.-CASE-STUDIES.md` (score: 2956.8)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nSambaNova SN40L 通过 streaming dataflow 架构将整个 Transformer decoder layer（20+ 算子）融合为单个 kernel call，中间结果通过片上 distributed SRAM（PCU/PMU 间的 RDN）流式传递，永不写入 HBM。其融合规模远超传统 compiler 的 1–5 个算子。代表性成果：Llama 3.1 405B 推理在 BF16 精度下达 129 tok/sec/user（当时最快公开 benchmark），HBM bandwidth 利用率 > 85%（GPU 方案通常 < 50%）。\n\n**方法细节（融合规模与收益对比）**：\n\n```\n融合粒度对比 (llama7B-4k-inference-prefill):\n\nUnfused baseline:\n  每层 decoder: ~30 个独立 kernel launch\n  中间 tensor: 全部经 HBM round-trip\n  Kernel launch overhead: 显著（decode 阶段尤为严重）\n\nConventional Fusion (TensorRT / Chimera / Welder):\n  融合粒度: 1–5 个算子\n  SMEM 容量限制: 227KB/SM → 大中间 tensor 融合失败\n  Kernel launch 减少: 2–3×\n  中间 tensor: SMEM 内传递（小 tensor）或 HBM spill（大 tensor）\n\nSambaNova SN40L Streaming Dataflow:\n  融合粒度: 20+ 算子（整个 decoder layer → 单 kernel）\n  中间结果: 仅经片上 SRAM/PCU-PMU dataflow（RDN）\n  Kernel launch: 1 次（整个 decoder）\n  HBM BW 利用率: >85%\n  操作强度提升: 2×–13× over unfused\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **融合收益分解**：prefill/training 1.5×–3×（提升 operational intensity），autoregressive decoding 1×–13×（消除 kernel launch overhead + 减少 HBM traffic），FlashFFTConv 13×（极低 operational intensity → fusion 效果最大）\n- **Hardware-Orchestrated Launch**：decoding 场景额外 1.4×–8× 加速——kernel 执行时间极短（微秒级），软件调度 overhead 占比大，AGC 硬件调度消除此开销\n- **三阶梯存储**：片上 distributed SRAM（PCU/PMU 近邻，高 BW 低延迟）→ HBM（64GB, 1.8TB/s）→ DDR（1.5TB, 200GB/s）。streaming dataflow 将 data movement 约束在前两级\n- **带宽利用率对比**：SN40L decoding 阶段 HBM BW 利用率 >85%（权重 streaming + KV cache 读取），H100 优化实现通常 <50%——差异来自 GPU 的 kernel launch overhead、control flow 开销和冗余 data movement\n- **CoE 部署优势**：单 SN40L Node (8 sockets) 可 hold 850+ experts (TP8 latency)，DGX H100 需 19 nodes。DDR→HBM copy 比 DGX 快 15–31×\n\n---\n\n## 四、不同硬件平台对并发模式的偏好差异（主内容）\n\n### 硬件平台并发范式系统对比\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Kitsune...` (score: 12458.8)，`paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashFuser...` (score: 28077.6)，`paper_secs/secs_2025/8-SambaNova_SN40L...` (score: 2956.8)，`paper_secs/secs_2025/11-StreamTensor...` (score: 11343.7)，`paper_secs/secs_2025/48-Meta_s Second Generation AI Chip...` (score: 920.3)，`idea_notes/HyTiS...` (score: 18.0)\n\n| 维度 | GPU SIMT (H100/A100) | NPU 脉动阵列 (Ascend 910B, MTIA 2i) | TPU Systolic Array (TPU v4/v5) | Dataflow 加速器 (SN40L, Groq LPU) |\n|------|---------------------|--------------------------------------|-------------------------------|------------------------------------|\n| **并发模型** | BSP→Dataflow (Kitsune); Warp-SIMT + Tensor Core MMA; Grid Scheduler 双 arbiter | 脉动阵列 data stationary; 异构: Cube(GEMM) + Vector(elementwise) + AI CPU(control) | 二维 systolic array (128×128 MXU); XLA 编译期静态调度 | 空间 dataflow; PCU/PMU streaming pipeline; 数据到达即触发 |\n| **算子融合偏好** | Vertical fusion (temporal); FlashFuser DSM spatial fusion (cluster 级) | CANN 编译器图融合 (MatMul+All-to-All); Cube/Vector 串行 | XLA fusion passes; compute-activation pattern; 编译期边界确定 | 极致 spatial fusion (20+ 算子→单 kernel); streaming intermediate 零 HBM traffic |\n| **并发粒度** | CTA 级 (Kitsune); Cluster 级 (FlashFuser DSM); Warp 级 (HyTiS tile) | 算子级 (Cube/Vector/AI CPU 分工); CANN stream 同步 | 编译期 subgraph 级; TPU core-local + cross-core ICI | Sub-operator tile 级; pipeline 级 streaming; 数据驱动同步 |\n| **通信-计算 Overlap** | Ring queue double buffering (Kitsune, L2); Split-phase P2P (PROBE); CUDA Stream async | Ring-based reduce-scatter + all-gather (Stratum NMP ring aggregator) | ICI ring-based 通信; XLA collective scheduling | Peer-to-peer streaming protocol (SN40L); RDN control fabric |\n| **Memory 层次** | HBM→L2→L1/SMEM→RF (5 级); DSM 作为 L1.5 (FlashFuser); L2-resident queue (Kitsune) | 片上 SRAM + HBM 两级; CANN memory reuse 框架规划 | HBM→CMEM→VMEM; XLA 静态 buffer allocation | 三级: 片上 SRAM→HBM→DDR (SN40L); 编译器静态 bandwidth 建模 |\n| **调度方式** | Grid Scheduler 硬件调度 + CUDA Streams; 动态 | Task Scheduler 硬件 + CANN Runtime; 半动态 | XLA compiler 静态 schedule; 运行时仅执行 | AGCU 硬件编排 (SN40L); 编译器静态 DAG; 无运行时动态决策 |\n| **适用场景** | 通用 DL; MoE (PROBE); 大 batch 吞吐优先 | 特定模型推理; 华为生态 (MindSpore+CANN) | Google 生态 (JAX/TF); 大规模训练+推理; 规则计算图 | CoE 组合推理; 低延迟 streaming; SRAM-resident 模型 |\n| **瓶颈特征** | Memory BW (decode); SMEM capacity (fusion fail); Wave quantization (SM 浪费) | 片上 SRAM 容量; Cube 利用率; 控制流灵活性 | HBM BW (大模型); ICI BW (跨 chip); 动态 routing 支持弱 | HBM capacity (大 CoE); 编译器静态 schedule→动态模型不友好 |\n\n**注解**：\n- **GPU SIMT** 的核心矛盾是 BSP 模型 vs DL graph structure 的 mismatch——Kitsune 通过 ring queue + modified grid scheduler 引入 dataflow；FlashFuser 利用 H100 DSM 将融合规模从 SM 扩展到 cluster。笔记显示 GPU decode 阶段 memory-bound（HBM BW 是瓶颈）→ 算子融合的主要收益来自 off-chip traffic 减少\n- **NPU 脉动阵列**（Ascend 910B）采用异构计算单元分工——CANN compiler 做图融合，将 MatMul+All-to-All 合并——但 Expert-Token Resonance idea note 明确标注 \"论文未详细说明 CANN 版本或融合策略细节\"。MTIA 2i 采用 8×8 PE array + NoC，TCO 比 GPU 低 44%，已在 Meta 生产环境服务数十亿用户\n- **TPU Systolic Array** 通过 XLA compiler 静态调度所有算子融合——编译时确定一切，运行时无动态决策——偏好规则 Transformer 计算图，对 MoE routing 类动态 pattern 支持较弱（笔记未提供 TPU 的专门 section 详细说明）\n- **Dataflow 加速器**（SN40L）是当前对多算子并发最友好的架构——天然匹配 streaming，无 kernel launch overhead，无软件同步——但需要 compiler 做 place-and-route（类似 FPGA 的 HLS 流程），灵活性受限于静态 schedule\n- **StreamTensor** (score: 11343.7) 提供了 dataflow 架构的通用编译框架——迭代 tensor type system 编码 stream layout，三级设计空间（tiling/fusion/resource）自动搜索——FPGA 评估显示比 SOTA FPGA 加速器延迟低 0.76×，比 GPU 低 0.64×，能效比 GPU 高 1.99×\n\n---\n\n## 五、设计空间探索与最佳实践总结\n\n### 设计空间五维轴\n\n基于 vault 笔记证据，面向硬件体系结构的多算子并发优化设计空间涵盖五个正交维度：\n\n| 设计维度 | 关键决策 | 硬件依赖 | 代表方法与笔记证据 |\n|----------|---------|---------|------------------|\n| **D1: 并发粒度** | CTA 级 / Cluster 级 / 算子级 / Sub-operator tile 级 | SM 数量、SMEM 容量、inter-SM 互联 BW | Kitsune (CTA), FlashFuser (Cluster), SambaNova (tile) |\n| **D2: 执行模型** | Temporal multiplexing vs Spatial concurrency | Grid Scheduler 灵活性、SM 资源类型多样性 | Vertical: Welder/Chimera; Spatial: Kitsune/FlashFuser |\n| **D3: 通信模式** | BSP barrier vs fine-grained queue vs streaming FIFO | 原子操作吞吐、L2 BW、片上网状/环状互联 | BSP: cuBLAS; Queue: Kitsune (ring); Streaming: SN40L |\n| **D4: 存储层级** | reg-only / +SMEM / +DSM / +HBM spilling | 各级容量和带宽比 | FlashFuser (3级), Kitsune (L2 queue), SambaNova (3级) |\n| **D5: 调度策略** | 静态编译 / 动态 runtime / 混合 (offline + online) | Profiling 成本、模型结构稳定性、batch 变化 | HyTiS (离线+在线), STOF (DFS+reward), PROBE (runtime) |\n\n### 最佳实践六原则\n\n**BP1: 按硬件 memory hierarchy 设计融合边界**（FlashFuser 证据, score: 28077.6）\n\n融合的可行性边界应由硬件 memory hierarchy 决定，而非算子语义：\n- 计算单 tile 中间 tensor 的 data footprint (DF)\n- DF ≤ reg → register tiling（最高 BW, 最低 latency）\n- reg < DF ≤ SMEM → SMEM double buffering\n- SMEM < DF ≤ DSM → dsm_comm primitives (FlashFuser)\n- DF > DSM → spatial partition along hidden dim (Kitsune)\n\n**BP2: 利用硬件互补资源实现控制面 offload**（PROBE 证据, score: 11001.9）\n\n识别执行流中 resource-usage gap（如 Nsight Compute SM/DRAM utilization < 33%）：\n- Network-bound 阶段 → 调度 control plane 计算（prediction, planning）\n- Compute-bound 阶段 → 调度 data movement（P2P prefetch, async copy）\n- Split-phase 技术避免不同通信模式的带宽竞争\n\n**BP3: Wave-aware 粒度调度避免 SM 利用率下降**（HyTiS 证据, score: 18.0）\n\nWave quantization 是 GPU 普遍问题：\n- Offline profiling 构建吞吐/延迟两类候选 micro-kernel\n- Runtime 判断 full wave vs partial wave → 自适应 tile 选择\n- Adaptive tile layout (GM vs GN) 优化 L2 cache affinity\n- 零额外同步开销（vs Split-K 的 reduction + 70%+ memory)\n\n**BP4: 算子融合表达为可搜索的编码空间**（STOF 证据, score: 1637.2）\n\nBinary hash encoding 量化抽象融合方案：\n- 为每算子分配编码位，同值相邻=同一融合段\n- Minimal action set (expand/seize/compete) 覆盖所有合法变换\n- DFS + performance cache 探索方案空间\n- Reward-based 参数采样聚焦最有希望段\n\n**BP5: 根据硬件并发模型选择正确的执行范式**\n\n- GPU (H100): FlashFuser DSM fusion (GEMM chain); Kitsune dataflow (异构算子混合)\n- SambaNova SN40L: 极致 streaming fusion (整 decoder→单 kernel)\n- TPU: XLA static fusion (规则 Transformer); MoE routing 回退动态调度\n- Ascend NPU: CANN MatMul+All-to-All 融合 + 异构单元分工\n\n**BP6: 异构存储的静态分层管理**（SambaNova SN40L 证据, score: 2956.8）\n\n- 权重保留 HBM（高 temporal locality: autoregressive decoding 中每 token 读取）\n- 中间激活可 spill 到 DDR（低 BW 需求: one-shot use）\n- 编译器 static symbol lifetime GC: 区间图着色 + first-fit 分配 + peak HBM 最小化\n- 实现单节点 150 experts (>1T parameters) 部署\n\n---\n\n## 六、是什么？（辅助说明）\n\n### 核心概念定义\n\n**算子排布与调度策略** 指在给定硬件计算/存储能力约束下，决定多个并发算子的执行顺序、资源分配、数据传递方式的系统方法。设计空间内：\n- **时间维度**：temporal multiplexing（vertical fusion，同 SM 上算子分时复用）vs spatial concurrency（dataflow，不同 SM 上算子空间并发）\n- **空间维度**：CTA 级（单 SM）→ Cluster 级（DSM，max 16 SM）→ Grid 级（全 GPU 多 kernel 并发）\n- **粒度维度**：粗粒度（整层/整模块）vs 细粒度（tile 级/微算子级）\n\n**计算与通信 Overlap** 利用硬件的异步执行能力实现计算和数据搬移的时间重叠：\n- Kitsune: 双缓冲 ring queue（L2 驻留）实现 producer-consumer pipeline\n- PROBE: split-phase P2P 传输在两个时间窗口（All-to-All 内/GEMM 内）分片进行\n- SambaNova SN40L: streaming weight load 与 computation 重叠（>85% HBM BW 利用率）\n\n**显存规划（Memory Planning）** 的核心是 tensor lifecycle management：\n- FlashFuser: 贪心 spill plan——tensor 优先放 fastest memory（reg→SMEM→DSM），容量不足时逐级溢出\n- SambaNova: compiler static symbol lifetime GC——区间图着色 + 异构存储 spill (HBM vs DDR)\n- Kitsune: L2-resident queue 作为中间 tensor 的 primary storage（消除 HBM round-trip）\n\n---\n\n## 七、实现（辅助说明）\n\n| 方法 | 实现框架 | 后端技术 | 部署方式 |\n|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| Kitsune | PyTorch Dynamo compiler | CUDA atomics + 自定义 cudaPipeline API | 编译器自动 lower + 手动 kernel 队列化 (~8 person-hours/operator) |\n| FlashFuser | CUTLASS-based compiler | TMA + mbarrier + wgmma (H100) | M-dimension binning + runtime table lookup |\n| PROBE | Python scheduler + NCCL | CUDA Stream + P2P + NCCL All-to-All | Runtime daemon 线程，控制面 offload |\n| HyTiS | Triton compiler | TMA (H100) / ldmatrix (A100) | Offline profiling + runtime 两级调度 |\n| STOF | PyTorch + Triton + TileLang | JIT ninja .so (MHA) + torch.compile (fusion) | fx.GraphModule graph capture |\n| SambaNova SN40L | SambaFlow compiler | PCU/PMU spatial mapping + AGCU | Python 框架级自动生成 fused kernel |\n\n---\n\n## 八、实验环境（辅助说明）\n\n| 方法 | 硬件平台 | 模型负载 | 关键指标 |\n|------|---------|---------|----------|\n| Kitsune | NVIDIA A100 (108 SM) | DLRM, MeshGraphNets, NeRF, GraphCast, Llama 3 8B | 1.3×–2.4× speedup; 41%–98% off-chip traffic ↓ |\n| FlashFuser | NVIDIA H100 SXM | GPT-6.7B, LLaMA-1B, OPT-1.3B, BERT, GPT-2 | 3.3× vs cuBLAS; 4.1× vs SOTA compilers; 58% memory ↓ |\n| PROBE | 8×GPU cluster (推断 A100) | MoE models (Mixtral 8×7B) | 1.32× prefill ↓; 1.3× decode throughput ↑ |\n| HyTiS | H100, A100 | GEMM micro-benchmark (多维度) | Wave quantization 消除; 36%→21% 陡降消除 |\n| STOF | RTX 4090, A100 | BERT, GPT-2, LLaMA, T5, ViT | 1.8×/1.6× vs FlexAttention; 1.3×/1.4× e2e |\n| SambaNova SN40L | 8–16 SN40L sockets | Llama 2/3.1 (7B–405B), Mistral, Falcon, BLOOM | 2×–13× fusion; 85% HBM BW; 3.7× vs DGX H100 |\n| StreamTensor | FPGA (dataflow accel.) | LLM Transformer decoder | 0.76×/0.64× latency vs SOTA; 1.99× energy vs GPU |\n\n---\n\n## 方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Kitsune** | Ring queue + 双 arbiter → BSP→Dataflow | PyTorch Dynamo + CUDA atomics | A100 | 1.3×–2.3×; 41%–98% off-chip↓ | paper_secs (12458.8) |\n| **FlashFuser** | DSM 三级 spilling + dsm_comm primitives | CUTLASS + TMA + mbarrier | H100 | 3.3× vs cuBLAS; 58% mem↓ | paper_secs (28077.6), idea (13.6) |\n| **PROBE** | Continuous Lookahead + Split-Phase P2P | Python + NCCL + CUDA Stream | 8×GPU | 1.32× prefill↓; 1.3× decode↑ | paper_secs (11001.9) |\n| **HyTiS** | 两级 tile + adaptive layout | Triton compiler | H100/A100 | Wave quantization 消除 | idea (18.0) |\n| **STOF** | Binary hash encoding + DFS/reward search | PyTorch+Triton+TileLang | RTX 4090, A100 | 1.8× vs FlexAttention; 1.4× e2e | paper_secs (1637.2) |\n| **SambaNova SN40L** | Streaming dataflow + 20+算子→单 kernel | SambaFlow + AGCU | SN40L RDU (5nm) | 2×–13×; >85% HBM BW | paper_secs (2956.8) |\n| **StreamTensor** | Iterative tensor type + 三级 DSE | FPGA compiler | FPGA | 0.76× latency; 1.99× energy | paper_secs (11343.7) |\n| **Stratum NMP Ring** | Bidirectional ring + in-situ aggregator | NMP logic die | 16 PU ring | 2.048 TB/s ring BW | knowledge (615.5) |\n\n---\n\n## 不确定性\n\n1. **华为 Ascend 910B CANN 融合细节缺失**：Expert-Token Resonance idea note 提及 CANN MatMul+All-to-All 融合，但明确标注 \"论文未详细说明 CANN 版本或融合策略细节\"。910B 的 Da Vinci 架构细节（Cube/Vector/AI CPU 并发能力）在 vault 中无专门 paper_secs——此处标记为「笔记未明确说明」。\n2. **Apple Neural Engine (ANE) 笔记完全缺失**：vault 未搜索到任何 ANE 架构笔记或论文 section，ANE 在多算子并发优化中的位置无法评估。\n3. **Google TPU v5e/v5p 并发细节不完整**：SambaNova 论文 Related Work 和 StreamTensor 论文提及 TPU，但 vault 中无 TPU 并发模式（XLA fusion pass 序列、ICI 调度策略、buffer allocation 算法）的专门笔记。\n4. **Video 模型的时空算子并发覆盖不足**：搜索命中主要集中在 MoE/LLM/Transformer 算子并发，Video-specific 的 spatial-temporal stream 并行编排在 vault 中缺少专门论文——标记为「笔记覆盖缺口」。\n5. **Groq LPU / Cerebras CS-3 细节**：vault 仅有间接引用（ELK/StreamTensor/SambaNova 论文 Related Work），无专门笔记或论文 section。\n6. **Memory planning 的形式化方法缺乏专门论文**：FlashFuser 的 dataflow analyzer 提供了 spilling 算法，SambaNova 提供了 static lifetime GC，但更 formal 的 tensor lifecycle optimization（如 recomputation/rematerialization 与并发的关系）在现有笔记中未见系统讨论——「可推断但笔记未明确定量」。\n7. **FP8/INT4 量化对算子融合影响**：笔记中 DMQ (score: 401.4) 涉及 Diffusion Model 量化但对量化如何与算子融合交互——如 FP8 GEMM 的 tile 约束差异、量化对 intermediate tensor size 的影响——笔记未明确说明。\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L1-Q1.6\n","userModified":false}}
