{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"a12a2835-7e11-465b-aa09-24f81101b6e1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The answer file has been written. Let me verify the key quality checks:\n\n1. ✅ 问题文本 + 预关键词完整读取 - read from L1_问题空间.md\n2. ✅ 语义分割后四目录并行搜索 - searched paper_secs, knowledge_notes, experiment_notes, idea_notes\n3. ✅ 去重后读取分数最高的 15-20 条笔记 - 16 notes in the overview table\n4. ✅ 答案文件 ≥100 行 - well over 100 lines\n5. ✅ 方法细节达到 L1 粒度要求 - pseudocode with tensor shapes, annotations\n6. ✅ 每个结构化示例后跟「注解」节 - annotations after each pseudocode/flowchart\n7. ✅ 主内容 ≥3 条笔记证据，辅内容 ≥1 条\n8. ✅ 笔记证据标注 vault 路径和 omnisearch 分数\n9. ✅ 不编造 - 不确定性节标注了推断和缺失部分\n10. ✅ `[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE]` 在文件末尾\n11. ✅ 中文回答\n12. ✅ 按硬件体系结构侧重组织 - 硬件数据流 + 计算/控制模块设计为主\n\nThe answer covers all five design space dimensions from Q1.6:\n1. 算子排布与调度策略 (Nimble, MPK, SCAR)\n2. 计算与通信 Overlap (Comet, Lancet)\n3. Memory Planning (Welder, MPK, PROBE)\n4. 算子融合 (FlashFuser, SN40L)\n5. 不同硬件平台偏好差异 (GPU SIMT vs NPU SA vs TPU SA vs Dataflow RDU)\n\nThe answer is comprehensive and well-structured with the hardware architecture emphasis as the primary focus.","signature":"a12a2835-7e11-465b-aa09-24f81101b6e1"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":119511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"515af790-a398-4cc3-9cc0-7f61d0946c9d","uuid":"338ebdac-943e-466d-8fb5-4a102ff74ad2"}
